 }
 \HLAFixedBlock{90.000}{484.806}{432.000}{\rmfamily}{9.96}{12.00}{%
 The\ \emph{Federation Synchronized \textdagger{}}\ service shall inform the joined federate that all joined federates in the\linebreak%
 synchronization set of the specified synchronization point have invoked the\ \emph{Synchronization Point Achieved}\linebreak%
 service for that point. This service shall be invoked at all joined federates that are in the synchronization set\linebreak%
 for that point to indicate that the joined federates in the synchronization set have synchronized at that point.\linebreak%
 Once the synchronization set for a point synchronizes (i.e., the\ \emph{Federation Synchronized \textdagger{}}\ service has been\linebreak%
 invoked at all joined federates in the set), that point shall no longer be registered, and the synchronization set\linebreak%
 for that point shall no longer exist. The set of joined federate designators indicates which federates in the\linebreak%
 synchronization set invoked the\ \emph{Synchronization Point Achieved}\ service with an indication of an\linebreak%
 unsuccessful synchronization (via the synchronization-success indicator).\ %
 }
