 4.23 \emph{Federation Saved \textdagger{}} service%
 }
 \HLAFixedBlock{90.000}{292.806}{432.000}{\rmfamily\raggedright}{9.96}{12.00}{%
 The \emph{Federation Saved \textdagger{}} service shall inform the joined federate that the federation save process is complete,%
 }
 \HLAFixedBlock{90.000}{304.805}{432.000}{\rmfamily\raggedright}{9.96}{12.00}{%
 and it shall indicate whether it completed successfully. A save-success indicator argument indicating success%
 }
 \HLAFixedBlock{90.000}{316.805}{432.000}{\rmfamily\raggedright}{9.96}{12.00}{%
 shall mean that all joined federates at which the \emph{Initiate Federate Save \textdagger{}} service was invoked have invoked%
 }
 \HLAFixedBlock{90.000}{328.805}{432.000}{\rmfamily\raggedright}{9.96}{12.00}{%
 the \emph{Federate Save Complete} service with a save-success indicator that indicated success. %
 }
 \HLAFixedBlock{90.000}{352.805}{432.000}{\rmfamily\raggedright}{9.96}{12.00}{%
 If the save-success indicator argument indicates failure, the optional failure reason argument shall be%
 }
 \HLAFixedBlock{90.000}{364.805}{432.000}{\rmfamily\raggedright}{9.96}{12.00}{%
 provided to identify the reason that the federation save failed. Possible reasons for the failure of a federation%
 }
 \HLAFixedBlock{90.000}{376.804}{432.000}{\rmfamily\raggedright}{9.96}{12.00}{%
 save are as follows:%
 }
 \HLAFixedBlock{100.020}{391.804}{421.980}{\rmfamily\raggedright}{9.96}{12.00}{%
 ---%
 }
 \HLAFixedBlock{121.980}{391.804}{400.020}{\rmfamily\raggedright}{9.96}{12.00}{%
 RTI was unable to save.%
 }
 \HLAFixedBlock{100.020}{406.804}{421.980}{\rmfamily\raggedright}{9.96}{12.00}{%
 ---%
 }
 \HLAFixedBlock{121.980}{406.804}{400.020}{\rmfamily\raggedright}{9.96}{12.00}{%
 One or more joined federates at which the \emph{Initiate Federate Save \textdagger{}} service was invoked have%
 }
 \HLAFixedBlock{121.980}{418.804}{400.020}{\rmfamily\raggedright}{9.96}{12.00}{%
 invoked the \emph{Federate Save Complete} service with a save-success indicator that indicated failure.%
 }
 \HLAFixedBlock{100.019}{433.803}{421.981}{\rmfamily\raggedright}{9.96}{12.00}{%
 ---%
 }
 \HLAFixedBlock{121.979}{433.803}{400.021}{\rmfamily\raggedright}{9.96}{12.00}{%
 One or more joined federates at which the \emph{Initiate Federate Save \textdagger{}} service was invoked have%
 }
 \HLAFixedBlock{121.979}{445.803}{400.021}{\rmfamily\raggedright}{9.96}{12.00}{%
 resigned from the federation execution.%
 }
 \HLAFixedBlock{100.019}{460.803}{421.981}{\rmfamily\raggedright}{9.96}{12.00}{%
 ---%
 }
 \HLAFixedBlock{121.979}{460.803}{400.021}{\rmfamily\raggedright}{9.96}{12.00}{%
 The RTI has detected failure at one or more of the joined federates at which the \emph{Initiate Federate}%
 }
 \HLAFixedBlock{121.979}{472.803}{400.021}{\rmfamily\raggedright}{9.96}{12.00}{%
 \emph{Save \textdagger{}} service was invoked.%
 }
 \HLAFixedBlock{100.019}{487.803}{421.981}{\rmfamily\raggedright}{9.96}{12.00}{%
 ---%
 }
 \HLAFixedBlock{121.979}{487.803}{400.021}{\rmfamily\raggedright}{9.96}{12.00}{%
 The optional timestamp supplied with the save request cannot be honored (due to possible race%
 }
 \HLAFixedBlock{121.979}{499.802}{400.021}{\rmfamily\raggedright}{9.96}{12.00}{%
 conditions in the distributed calculation of GALT).%
 }
 \HLAFixedBlock{100.019}{514.802}{421.981}{\rmfamily\raggedright}{9.96}{12.00}{%
 ---%
 }
 \HLAFixedBlock{121.979}{514.802}{400.021}{\rmfamily\raggedright}{9.96}{12.00}{%
 Federation save aborted.%
 }
 \HLAFixedBlock{89.999}{538.802}{432.001}{\rmfamily\raggedright}{9.96}{12.00}{%
 All joined federates that received an invocation of the \emph{Initiate Federate Save \textdagger{}} service shall receive an%
 }
 \HLAFixedBlock{89.999}{550.802}{432.001}{\rmfamily\raggedright}{9.96}{12.00}{%
 invocation of the \emph{Federation Saved \textdagger{}} service. Also, a joined federate that has invoked the \emph{Request}%
 }
 \HLAFixedBlock{89.999}{562.801}{432.001}{\rmfamily\raggedright}{9.96}{12.00}{%
 \emph{Federation Save} service may receive an invocation of the \emph{Federation Saved \textdagger{}} service without having first%
 }
 \HLAFixedBlock{89.999}{574.801}{432.001}{\rmfamily\raggedright}{9.96}{12.00}{%
 received an invocation of the \emph{Initiate Federate Save \textdagger{}} service.%
 }
 \HLAServiceComponentHeadingAt{598.661}{%
 4.23.1 Supplied arguments%
 }
