 }
 \HLAFixedBlock{90.001}{106.806}{431.999}{\rmfamily\raggedright}{9.96}{12.00}{%
 attempt. If the restore was successful, the joined federate shall be in the state that either it or some other%
 }
 \HLAFixedBlock{90.001}{118.805}{431.999}{\rmfamily\raggedright}{9.96}{12.00}{%
 joined federate of its type was in when the federation save associated with the label occurred, with the%
 }
 \HLAFixedBlock{90.001}{130.805}{431.999}{\rmfamily\raggedright}{9.96}{12.00}{%
 distinction that the joined federate shall now be waiting for an invocation of the \emph{Federation Restored \textdagger{}}%
 }
 \HLAFixedBlock{90.001}{142.805}{431.999}{\rmfamily\raggedright}{9.96}{12.00}{%
 service.%
 }
