 \HLAFixedBlock{90.000}{69.786}{432.000}{\rmfamily\raggedright}{9.96}{12.00}{%
 If the restore-success indicator argument indicates failure, the optional failure reason argument shall be%
 }
 \HLAFixedBlock{90.000}{81.785}{432.000}{\rmfamily\raggedright}{9.96}{12.00}{%
 provided to identify the reason that the federation restore failed. Possible reasons for the failure of a%
 }
 \HLAFixedBlock{90.000}{93.785}{432.000}{\rmfamily\raggedright}{9.96}{12.00}{%
 federation restore are as follows:%
 }
 \HLAFixedBlock{100.020}{108.785}{421.980}{\rmfamily\raggedright}{9.96}{12.00}{%
 ---%
 }
 \HLAFixedBlock{121.980}{108.785}{400.020}{\rmfamily\raggedright}{9.96}{12.00}{%
 The RTI was unable to restore.%
 }
 \HLAFixedBlock{100.020}{123.785}{421.980}{\rmfamily\raggedright}{9.96}{12.00}{%
 ---%
 }
 \HLAFixedBlock{121.980}{123.785}{400.020}{\rmfamily\raggedright}{9.96}{12.00}{%
 One or more joined federates at which the \emph{Federation Restore Begun \textdagger{}} service was invoked have%
 }
 \HLAFixedBlock{121.981}{135.785}{400.019}{\rmfamily\raggedright}{9.96}{12.00}{%
 invoked the \emph{Federate Restore Complete} service with a restore-success indicator that indicated%
 }
 \HLAFixedBlock{121.982}{147.784}{400.018}{\rmfamily\raggedright}{9.96}{12.00}{%
 failure.%
 }
 \HLAFixedBlock{100.022}{162.784}{421.978}{\rmfamily\raggedright}{9.96}{12.00}{%
 ---%
 }
 \HLAFixedBlock{121.982}{162.784}{400.018}{\rmfamily\raggedright}{9.96}{12.00}{%
 One or more joined federates at which the \emph{Federation Restore Begun \textdagger{}} service was invoked have%
 }
 \HLAFixedBlock{121.983}{174.784}{400.017}{\rmfamily\raggedright}{9.96}{12.00}{%
 resigned.%
 }
 \HLAFixedBlock{100.023}{189.784}{421.977}{\rmfamily\raggedright}{9.96}{12.00}{%
 ---%
 }
 \HLAFixedBlock{121.983}{189.784}{400.017}{\rmfamily\raggedright}{9.96}{12.00}{%
 The RTI detected failure at one or more of the joined federates at which the \emph{Federation Restore}%
 }
 \HLAFixedBlock{121.983}{201.784}{400.017}{\rmfamily\raggedright}{9.96}{12.00}{%
 \emph{Begun \textdagger{}} service was invoked.%
 }
 \HLAFixedBlock{100.023}{216.783}{421.977}{\rmfamily\raggedright}{9.96}{12.00}{%
 ---%
 }
 \HLAFixedBlock{121.983}{216.783}{400.017}{\rmfamily\raggedright}{9.96}{12.00}{%
 Federation restore aborted.%
 }
 \HLAFixedBlock{90.003}{240.783}{431.997}{\rmfamily\raggedright}{9.96}{12.00}{%
 All joined federates that received an invocation of the \emph{Federation Restore Begun \textdagger{}} service shall receive an%
 }
 \HLAFixedBlock{90.003}{252.783}{431.997}{\rmfamily\raggedright}{9.96}{12.00}{%
 invocation of the \emph{Federation Restored \textdagger{}} service. If a joined federate that received an invocation of the%
 }
 \HLAFixedBlock{90.003}{264.783}{431.997}{\rmfamily\raggedright}{9.96}{12.00}{%
 \emph{Federation Restore Begun \textdagger{}} service resigns from the federation execution before the \emph{Federation Restored \textdagger{}}%
 }
 \HLAFixedBlock{90.003}{276.782}{431.997}{\rmfamily\raggedright}{9.96}{12.00}{%
 service for that restore is invoked, this resignation shall be considered a failure of the federation restoration,%
 }
 \HLAFixedBlock{90.003}{288.782}{431.997}{\rmfamily\raggedright}{9.96}{12.00}{%
 and the \emph{Federation Restored \textdagger{}} service shall be invoked with a restore-success indicator of failure.%
 }
