\thispagestyle{hla-body}
\begin{hlafixedpage}
 \HLAFixedBlock{90.000}{69.786}{432.000}{\rmfamily\raggedright}{9.96}{12.00}{%
 The service takes no arguments and affects the current restore. This service may be invoked only while the%
 }
 \HLAFixedBlock{90.000}{81.785}{432.000}{\rmfamily\raggedright}{9.96}{12.00}{%
 federate is in the Federate Restore in Progress state. Upon return of the service invocation, a request to abort%
 }
 \HLAFixedBlock{90.000}{93.785}{432.000}{\rmfamily\raggedright}{9.96}{12.00}{%
 the current restore has successfully been made.%
 }
 \HLAFixedBlock{90.000}{117.785}{432.000}{\rmfamily\raggedright}{9.96}{12.00}{%
 The RTI shall abort the current restore by invoking the \emph{Federation Restored \textdagger{}} service on all federates that%
 }
 \HLAFixedBlock{90.000}{129.785}{432.000}{\rmfamily\raggedright}{9.96}{12.00}{%
 are in the Federate Restore in Progress state, regardless of each individual federate’s restore substate. Joined%
 }
 \HLAFixedBlock{89.999}{141.785}{432.001}{\rmfamily\raggedright}{9.96}{12.00}{%
 federates not in the Federation Restore in Progress state may not receive the \emph{Federation Restore Begun \textdagger{}}%
 }
 \HLAFixedBlock{90.000}{153.784}{432.000}{\rmfamily\raggedright}{9.96}{12.00}{%
 callback for this federation restore. The restore-success indicator for the \emph{Federation Restored \textdagger{}} service shall%
 }
 \HLAFixedBlock{89.999}{165.784}{432.001}{\rmfamily\raggedright}{9.96}{12.00}{%
 indicate failure (federation restore aborted) if not all federates have successfully invoked the \emph{Federate}%
 }
 \HLAFixedBlock{89.999}{177.784}{432.001}{\rmfamily\raggedright}{9.96}{12.00}{%
 \emph{Restore Complete} service with a restore-success indicator indicating success. Since a federate remains in the%
 }
 \HLAFixedBlock{89.998}{189.784}{432.002}{\rmfamily\raggedright}{9.96}{12.00}{%
 Federate Restore in Progress state after it successfully invokes the \emph{Federate Restore Complete} service and%
 }
 \HLAFixedBlock{89.997}{201.784}{432.003}{\rmfamily\raggedright}{9.96}{12.00}{%
 before the \emph{Federation Restored \textdagger{}} service is invoked on it by the RTI, it is possible that all other federates%
 }
 \HLAFixedBlock{89.997}{213.783}{432.003}{\rmfamily\raggedright}{9.96}{12.00}{%
 may have also already invoked the \emph{Federate Restore Complete} service with a success indicator indicating%
 }
 \HLAFixedBlock{89.997}{225.783}{432.003}{\rmfamily\raggedright}{9.96}{12.00}{%
 success. In this case, it is possible that the \emph{Federation Restored \textdagger{}} service is invoked at each federate with a%
 }
 \HLAFixedBlock{89.997}{237.783}{432.003}{\rmfamily\raggedright}{9.96}{12.00}{%
 success indicator indicating success after invocation of the \emph{Abort Federation Restore} service.%
 }
 \HLAServiceComponentHeadingAt{261.643}{%
 4.33.1 Supplied arguments%
 }
 \HLAFixedBlock{100.016}{285.782}{421.984}{\rmfamily\raggedright}{9.96}{12.00}{%
