 }
 \HLAFixedBlock{90.000}{455.766}{432.000}{\rmfamily\raggedright}{9.96}{12.00}{%
 The \emph{Federation Restore Status Response \textdagger{}} service shall be used to provide the status of a federation restore.%
 }
 \HLAFixedBlock{90.001}{467.765}{431.999}{\rmfamily\raggedright}{9.96}{12.00}{%
 This service shall be invoked by the RTI at a joined federate in response to a \emph{Query Federation Restore}%
 }
 \HLAFixedBlock{90.001}{479.825}{431.999}{\rmfamily\raggedright}{9.96}{12.00}{%
 \emph{Status} service invocation by the same joined federate. This service shall supply a list of restore status%
 }
 \HLAFixedBlock{90.001}{491.825}{431.999}{\rmfamily\raggedright}{9.96}{12.00}{%
 descriptors. The list shall contain one descriptor for each joined federate participating in the restore. A%
 }
 \HLAFixedBlock{90.000}{503.825}{432.000}{\rmfamily\raggedright}{9.96}{12.00}{%
 restore status descriptor shall have the following information:%
 }
 \HLAFixedBlock{100.020}{524.824}{421.980}{\rmfamily\raggedright}{9.96}{12.00}{%
 ---%
 }
 \HLAFixedBlock{121.980}{524.824}{400.020}{\rmfamily\raggedright}{9.96}{12.00}{%
 Pre-restore joined federate designator%
 }
 \HLAFixedBlock{100.020}{539.824}{421.980}{\rmfamily\raggedright}{9.96}{12.00}{%
 ---%
 }
 \HLAFixedBlock{121.980}{539.824}{400.020}{\rmfamily\raggedright}{9.96}{12.00}{%
 Post-restore joined federate designator%
 }
 \HLAFixedBlock{100.020}{554.824}{421.980}{\rmfamily\raggedright}{9.96}{12.00}{%
 ---%
 }
 \HLAFixedBlock{121.980}{554.824}{400.020}{\rmfamily\raggedright}{9.96}{12.00}{%
 Restore status%
 }
 \HLAFixedBlock{90.000}{578.823}{432.000}{\rmfamily\raggedright}{9.96}{12.00}{%
 A joined federate shall use the pre-restore joined federate designators to identify joined federates until the%
 }
 \HLAFixedBlock{90.000}{590.823}{432.000}{\rmfamily\raggedright}{9.96}{12.00}{%
 \emph{Initiate Federate Restore \textdagger{}} service has been successfully invoked and indicates restore successful at that%
 }
 \HLAFixedBlock{90.001}{602.823}{431.999}{\rmfamily\raggedright}{9.96}{12.00}{%
 joined federate. After that successful service invocation, that joined federate shall use the post-restore joined%
 }
 \HLAFixedBlock{90.001}{614.823}{431.999}{\rmfamily\raggedright}{9.96}{12.00}{%
 federate designators to identify joined federates.%
 }
 \HLAFixedBlock{90.001}{638.822}{431.999}{\rmfamily\raggedright}{9.96}{12.00}{%
 A restore status descriptor with a federate status of “No federate restore in progress” shall have a null%
 }
 \HLAFixedBlock{90.001}{650.822}{431.999}{\rmfamily\raggedright}{9.96}{12.00}{%
 designator for the post-restore joined federate designator. The post-restore joined federate designator in this%
 }
 \HLAFixedBlock{90.001}{662.822}{431.999}{\rmfamily\raggedright}{9.96}{12.00}{%
 case has no meaning since the federate is not participating in a restore.%
 }
 \HLAFixedBlock{90.001}{686.822}{431.999}{\rmfamily\raggedright}{9.96}{12.00}{%
 A joined federate restore status shall be one of the following values:%
 }
 \HLAFixedBlock{100.021}{707.821}{421.979}{\rmfamily\raggedright}{9.96}{12.00}{%
 ---%
 }
 \HLAFixedBlock{121.981}{707.821}{400.019}{\rmfamily\raggedright}{9.96}{12.00}{%
 No federate restore in progress%
 }
