 \HLAServiceComponentHeadingAt{165.645}{%
 5.1.2 Definitions and constraints for object classes and class attributes%
 }
 \HLAFixedBlock{89.999}{189.784}{432.001}{\rmfamily\raggedright}{9.96}{12.00}{%
 The following DM definitions and constraints shall pertain to object classes and class attributes as declared%
 }
 \HLAFixedBlock{89.999}{201.784}{432.001}{\rmfamily\raggedright}{9.96}{12.00}{%
 in the class hierarchy of the FDD:%
 }
 \HLAFixedBlock{100.019}{213.783}{421.981}{\rmfamily\raggedright}{9.96}{12.00}{%
 a)%
 }
 \HLAFixedBlock{121.979}{213.783}{400.021}{\rmfamily\raggedright}{9.96}{12.00}{%
 A class attribute may be used as an argument to \emph{Subscribe Object Class Attributes}, \emph{Unsubscribe}%
 }
 \HLAFixedBlock{121.979}{225.783}{400.021}{\rmfamily\raggedright}{9.96}{12.00}{%
 \emph{Object Class Attributes, Publish Object Class Attributes}, and \emph{Unpublish Object Class Attributes}%
 }
 \HLAFixedBlock{121.979}{237.783}{400.021}{\rmfamily\raggedright}{9.96}{12.00}{%
 service invocations for a particular object class if and only if the attribute is an available attribute of%
 }
 \HLAFixedBlock{121.979}{249.783}{400.021}{\rmfamily\raggedright}{9.96}{12.00}{%
 that object class.%
 }
 \HLAFixedBlock{100.019}{261.783}{421.981}{\rmfamily\raggedright}{9.96}{12.00}{%
 b)%
 }
 \HLAFixedBlock{121.935}{261.783}{400.065}{\rmfamily\raggedright}{9.96}{12.00}{%
 From a joined federate’s perspective, the \textbf{subscribed attributes of an object class} shall be all of the%
 }
 \HLAFixedBlock{121.979}{273.783}{400.021}{\rmfamily\raggedright}{9.96}{12.00}{%
 class attributes that have been arguments to \emph{Subscribe Object Class Attributes }service invocations by%
 }
 \HLAFixedBlock{121.980}{285.782}{400.020}{\rmfamily\raggedright}{9.96}{12.00}{%
 that joined federate for that object class and that have not subsequently been unsubscribed, either%
 }
 \HLAFixedBlock{121.980}{297.782}{400.020}{\rmfamily\raggedright}{9.96}{12.00}{%
 individually or by unsubscribing the whole object class. \emph{Subscribe Object Class Attributes} and%
 }
 \HLAFixedBlock{121.980}{309.782}{400.020}{\rmfamily\raggedright}{9.96}{12.00}{%
 \emph{Unsubscribe Object Class Attributes} service invocations for one object class shall have no effect on%
 }
 \HLAFixedBlock{121.979}{321.782}{400.021}{\rmfamily\raggedright}{9.96}{12.00}{%
 the subscribed attributes of any other object class.%
 }
 \HLAFixedBlock{100.019}{333.782}{421.981}{\rmfamily\raggedright}{9.96}{12.00}{%
 c)%
 }
 \HLAFixedBlock{121.978}{333.782}{400.022}{\rmfamily\raggedright}{9.96}{12.00}{%
 If a class attribute is a subscribed attribute of an object class, the joined federate shall be subscribed%
 }
 \HLAFixedBlock{121.979}{345.781}{400.021}{\rmfamily\raggedright}{9.96}{12.00}{%
 to that class attribute either actively or passively, but not both.%
 }
 \HLAFixedBlock{100.019}{357.781}{421.981}{\rmfamily\raggedright}{9.96}{12.00}{%
 d)%
 }
 \HLAFixedBlock{121.938}{357.781}{400.062}{\rmfamily\raggedright}{9.96}{12.00}{%
 From a joined federate’s perspective, the \textbf{explicitly published attributes of an object class} shall be%
 }
 \HLAFixedBlock{121.980}{369.781}{400.020}{\rmfamily\raggedright}{9.96}{12.00}{%
 all the class attributes that have been arguments to \emph{Publish Object Class Attributes} service%
 }
 \HLAFixedBlock{121.981}{381.781}{400.019}{\rmfamily\raggedright}{9.96}{12.00}{%
 invocations by that joined federate for that object class and that have not subsequently been%
 }
 \HLAFixedBlock{121.981}{393.781}{400.019}{\rmfamily\raggedright}{9.96}{12.00}{%
 unpublished, either individually or by unpublishing the whole object class.%
 }
 \HLAFixedBlock{100.021}{405.780}{421.979}{\rmfamily\raggedright}{9.96}{12.00}{%
 e)%
 }
 \HLAFixedBlock{121.979}{405.780}{400.021}{\rmfamily\raggedright}{9.96}{12.00}{%
 When there are no explicitly published attributes of an object class for a given joined federate, the%
 }
 \HLAFixedBlock{121.981}{417.780}{400.019}{\rmfamily\raggedright}{9.96}{12.00}{%
 first \emph{Publish Object Class Attributes} service invocation that results in explicitly published attributes%
 }
 \HLAFixedBlock{121.981}{429.780}{400.019}{\rmfamily\raggedright}{9.96}{12.00}{%
 for that object class for that joined federate also results in \textbf{publication being established} for that%
 }
 \HLAFixedBlock{121.980}{441.780}{400.020}{\rmfamily\raggedright}{9.96}{12.00}{%
 object class at that joined federate.%
 }
 \HLAFixedBlock{100.020}{453.780}{421.980}{\rmfamily\raggedright}{9.96}{12.00}{%
 f)%
 }
 \HLAFixedBlock{121.964}{453.780}{400.036}{\rmfamily\raggedright}{9.96}{12.00}{%
 The \textbf{HLAprivilegeToDeleteObject} class attribute shall be implicitly published for a joined federate%
 }
 \HLAFixedBlock{121.980}{465.780}{400.020}{\rmfamily\raggedright}{9.96}{12.00}{%
 for an object class, if and only if%
 }
 \HLAFixedBlock{121.980}{480.779}{400.020}{\rmfamily\raggedright}{9.96}{12.00}{%
 1)%
 }
 \HLAFixedBlock{142.018}{480.779}{379.982}{\rmfamily\raggedright}{9.96}{12.00}{%
 The \textbf{HLAprivilegeToDeleteObject} class attribute for the object class is not, nor has been since%
 }
 \HLAFixedBlock{142.020}{492.779}{379.980}{\rmfamily\raggedright}{9.96}{12.00}{%
 publication of the object class was most recently established, explicitly published by the joined%
 }
 \HLAFixedBlock{142.019}{504.779}{379.981}{\rmfamily\raggedright}{9.96}{12.00}{%
 federate.%
 }
 \HLAFixedBlock{121.980}{519.779}{400.020}{\rmfamily\raggedright}{9.96}{12.00}{%
 2)%
 }
 \HLAFixedBlock{142.017}{519.779}{379.983}{\rmfamily\raggedright}{9.96}{12.00}{%
 The \textbf{HLAprivilegeToDeleteObject} class attribute for the object class has not been explicitly%
 }
 \HLAFixedBlock{142.020}{531.779}{379.980}{\rmfamily\raggedright}{9.96}{12.00}{%
 unpublished by the joined federate since publication of the object class was most recently%
 }
 \HLAFixedBlock{142.020}{543.778}{379.980}{\rmfamily\raggedright}{9.96}{12.00}{%
 established.%
 }
 \HLAFixedBlock{121.981}{558.778}{400.019}{\rmfamily\raggedright}{9.96}{12.00}{%
 3)%
 }
 \HLAFixedBlock{142.025}{558.778}{379.975}{\rmfamily\raggedright}{9.96}{12.00}{%
 At least one attribute of the object class is explicitly published by the joined federate.%
 }
 \HLAFixedBlock{100.021}{573.778}{421.979}{\rmfamily\raggedright}{9.96}{12.00}{%
 g)%
 }
 \HLAFixedBlock{121.943}{573.778}{400.057}{\rmfamily\raggedright}{9.96}{12.00}{%
 From a joined federate’s perspective, the published attributes of an object class shall be the explicitly%
 }
 \HLAFixedBlock{121.981}{585.778}{400.019}{\rmfamily\raggedright}{9.96}{12.00}{%
 published and the implicitly published, if any, attributes of the object class for the joined federate.%
 }
 \HLAFixedBlock{121.981}{597.777}{400.019}{\rmfamily\raggedright}{9.96}{12.00}{%
 \emph{Publish Object Class Attributes} and \emph{Unpublish Object Class Attributes} service invocations for one%
 }
 \HLAFixedBlock{121.981}{609.777}{400.019}{\rmfamily\raggedright}{9.96}{12.00}{%
 object class shall have no effect on the published attributes of any other object class.%
 }
 \HLAFixedBlock{100.021}{621.777}{421.979}{\rmfamily\raggedright}{9.96}{12.00}{%
 h)%
 }
 \HLAFixedBlock{121.940}{621.777}{400.060}{\rmfamily\raggedright}{9.96}{12.00}{%
 From a joined federate’s perspective, an object class shall be \textbf{subscribed}\emph{ }if and only if the joined%
 }
 \HLAFixedBlock{121.980}{633.786}{400.020}{\rmfamily\raggedright}{9.96}{12.00}{%
 federate is subscribed to at least one attribute of the object class.%
 }
 \HLAFixedBlock{100.019}{645.785}{421.981}{\rmfamily\raggedright}{9.96}{12.00}{%
 i)%
 }
 \HLAFixedBlock{121.968}{645.785}{400.032}{\rmfamily\raggedright}{9.96}{12.00}{%
 From a joined federate’s perspective, an object class shall be \textbf{published}\emph{ }if and only if at least one%
 }
 \HLAFixedBlock{121.979}{657.785}{400.021}{\rmfamily\raggedright}{9.96}{12.00}{%
 attribute of the object class is published by the joined federate.%
 }
 \HLAFixedBlock{100.019}{669.785}{421.981}{\rmfamily\raggedright}{9.96}{12.00}{%
 j)%
 }
 \HLAFixedBlock{121.981}{669.785}{400.019}{\rmfamily\raggedright}{9.96}{12.00}{%
 Joined federates shall invoke the \emph{Register Object Instance} service only with a published object class%
 }
 \HLAFixedBlock{121.980}{681.785}{400.020}{\rmfamily\raggedright}{9.96}{12.00}{%
 as an argument.%
 }
 \HLAFixedBlock{100.020}{693.785}{421.980}{\rmfamily\raggedright}{9.96}{12.00}{%
 k)%
 }
 \HLAFixedBlock{121.958}{693.785}{400.042}{\rmfamily\raggedright}{9.96}{12.00}{%
 The \textbf{registered class} of an object instance shall be the object class that was an argument to the%
 }
 \HLAFixedBlock{121.981}{705.784}{400.019}{\rmfamily\raggedright}{9.96}{12.00}{%
 \emph{Register Object Instance} service invocation for that object instance.%
 }
\end{hlafixedpage}
\clearpage

\HLASourcePage{84}{83}
\HLAServiceBookmark{5.1.3}{2}{Definitions and constraints for interaction classes and parameters}
\thispagestyle{hla-body}
\begin{hlafixedpage}
 \HLAFixedBlock{100.020}{69.786}{421.980}{\rmfamily\raggedright}{9.96}{12.00}{%
 l)%
 }
 \HLAFixedBlock{121.950}{69.786}{400.050}{\rmfamily\raggedright}{9.96}{12.00}{%
 Every object instance shall have one federation-wide registered class that cannot change.%
 }
 \HLAFixedBlock{100.020}{81.785}{421.980}{\rmfamily\raggedright}{9.96}{12.00}{%
 m)%
 }
 \HLAFixedBlock{121.971}{81.785}{400.029}{\rmfamily\raggedright}{9.96}{12.00}{%
 If the \emph{Discover Object Instance \textdagger{}} service is invoked at a joined federate, the object instance%
 }
 \HLAFixedBlock{121.981}{93.785}{400.019}{\rmfamily\raggedright}{9.96}{12.00}{%
 discovered as a result of this service invocation shall have a \textbf{discovered class} at that joined federate.%
 }
 \HLAFixedBlock{121.981}{105.785}{400.019}{\rmfamily\raggedright}{9.96}{12.00}{%
 The discovered class of the object instance shall be a supplied argument to the \emph{Discover Object}%
 }
 \HLAFixedBlock{121.981}{117.785}{400.019}{\rmfamily\raggedright}{9.96}{12.00}{%
 \emph{Instance \textdagger{}} service invocation.%
 }
 \HLAFixedBlock{100.021}{129.785}{421.979}{\rmfamily\raggedright}{9.96}{12.00}{%
 n)%
 }
 \HLAFixedBlock{121.941}{129.785}{400.059}{\rmfamily\raggedright}{9.96}{12.00}{%
 An object instance shall have at most one discovered class in each joined federate. This discovered%
 }
 \HLAFixedBlock{121.982}{141.785}{400.018}{\rmfamily\raggedright}{9.96}{12.00}{%
 class may vary from joined federate to joined federate. Once an object instance is discovered, its%
 }
 \HLAFixedBlock{121.982}{153.784}{400.018}{\rmfamily\raggedright}{9.96}{12.00}{%
 discovered class shall not change. If a joined federate invokes the \emph{Local Delete Object Instance}%
 }
 \HLAFixedBlock{121.982}{165.784}{400.018}{\rmfamily\raggedright}{9.96}{12.00}{%
 service for a given object instance, that object instance may be newly discovered, at a possibly%
 }
 \HLAFixedBlock{121.982}{177.784}{400.018}{\rmfamily\raggedright}{9.96}{12.00}{%
 different object class from previously known.%
 }
 \HLAFixedBlock{100.022}{189.784}{421.978}{\rmfamily\raggedright}{9.96}{12.00}{%
 o)%
 }
 \HLAFixedBlock{121.982}{189.784}{400.018}{\rmfamily\raggedright}{9.96}{12.00}{%
 If a joined federate has registered or discovered an object instance and it has not subsequently%
 }
 \HLAFixedBlock{121.983}{204.784}{400.017}{\rmfamily\raggedright}{9.96}{12.00}{%
 1)%
 }
 \HLAFixedBlock{142.024}{204.784}{379.976}{\rmfamily\raggedright}{9.96}{12.00}{%
 Invoked the \emph{Local Delete Object Instance }service for that object instance,%
 }
 \HLAFixedBlock{121.984}{219.783}{400.016}{\rmfamily\raggedright}{9.96}{12.00}{%
 2)%
 }
 \HLAFixedBlock{142.022}{219.783}{379.978}{\rmfamily\raggedright}{9.96}{12.00}{%
 Invoked the\emph{ Delete Object Instance }service for that object instance, or%
 }
 \HLAFixedBlock{121.984}{234.783}{400.016}{\rmfamily\raggedright}{9.96}{12.00}{%
 3)%
 }
 \HLAFixedBlock{142.035}{234.783}{379.965}{\rmfamily\raggedright}{9.96}{12.00}{%
 Received an invocation of the \emph{Remove Object Instance \textdagger{}} service for that object instance, %
 }
 \HLAFixedBlock{121.984}{261.783}{400.016}{\rmfamily\raggedright}{9.96}{12.00}{%
 then the object instance shall be known to that joined federate and that object instance has a known%
 }
 \HLAFixedBlock{121.984}{273.782}{400.016}{\rmfamily\raggedright}{9.96}{12.00}{%
 class at that joined federate. The known class of that object instance at that joined federate shall be%
 }
 \HLAFixedBlock{121.985}{285.782}{400.015}{\rmfamily\raggedright}{9.96}{12.00}{%
 the object instance’s registered class if the joined federate knows about the object instance as a result%
 }
 \HLAFixedBlock{121.985}{297.782}{400.015}{\rmfamily\raggedright}{9.96}{12.00}{%
 of having registered it. The known class of that object instance at that joined federate shall be the%
 }
 \HLAFixedBlock{121.985}{309.782}{400.015}{\rmfamily\raggedright}{9.96}{12.00}{%
 object instance’s discovered class if the joined federate knows about the object instance as a result of%
 }
 \HLAFixedBlock{121.985}{321.782}{400.015}{\rmfamily\raggedright}{9.96}{12.00}{%
 having discovered it.%
 }
 \HLAFixedBlock{100.025}{333.782}{421.975}{\rmfamily\raggedright}{9.96}{12.00}{%
 p)%
 }
 \HLAFixedBlock{121.943}{333.782}{400.057}{\rmfamily\raggedright}{9.96}{12.00}{%
 From a joined federate’s perspective, the corresponding class attribute of an instance attribute is the%
 }
 \HLAFixedBlock{121.986}{345.781}{400.014}{\rmfamily\raggedright}{9.96}{12.00}{%
 class attribute of the joined federate’s known class for the object instance containing the instance%
 }
 \HLAFixedBlock{121.987}{357.781}{400.013}{\rmfamily\raggedright}{9.96}{12.00}{%
 attribute that has the same attribute designator as the instance attribute.%
 }
 \HLAFixedBlock{100.026}{369.781}{421.974}{\rmfamily\raggedright}{9.96}{12.00}{%
 q)%
 }
 \HLAFixedBlock{121.944}{369.781}{400.056}{\rmfamily\raggedright}{9.96}{12.00}{%
 From a joined federate’s perspective, the corresponding instance attributes of a class attribute are%
 }
 \HLAFixedBlock{121.986}{384.781}{400.014}{\rmfamily\raggedright}{9.96}{12.00}{%
 1)%
 }
 \HLAFixedBlock{142.030}{384.781}{379.970}{\rmfamily\raggedright}{9.96}{12.00}{%
 All unowned instance attributes of object instances that have a known class at the joined%
 }
 \HLAFixedBlock{142.025}{396.781}{379.975}{\rmfamily\raggedright}{9.96}{12.00}{%
 federate equal to the object class of the class attribute and that have the same attribute%
 }
 \HLAFixedBlock{142.025}{408.780}{379.975}{\rmfamily\raggedright}{9.96}{12.00}{%
 designator as the class attribute, and %
 }
 \HLAFixedBlock{121.986}{423.780}{400.014}{\rmfamily\raggedright}{9.96}{12.00}{%
 2)%
 }
 \HLAFixedBlock{142.025}{423.780}{379.975}{\rmfamily\raggedright}{9.96}{12.00}{%
 All instance attributes owned by the joined federate that belong to object instances that have a%
 }
 \HLAFixedBlock{142.025}{435.780}{379.975}{\rmfamily\raggedright}{9.96}{12.00}{%
 known class at the owning federate equal to the object class of the class attribute and that have%
 }
 \HLAFixedBlock{142.025}{447.780}{379.975}{\rmfamily\raggedright}{9.96}{12.00}{%
 the same attribute designator as the class attribute.%
 }
 \HLAFixedBlock{100.025}{462.780}{421.975}{\rmfamily\raggedright}{9.96}{12.00}{%
 r)%
 }
 \HLAFixedBlock{121.946}{462.780}{400.054}{\rmfamily\raggedright}{9.96}{12.00}{%
 A joined federate shall own and update only an instance attribute for which it is publishing the%
 }
 \HLAFixedBlock{121.985}{474.779}{400.015}{\rmfamily\raggedright}{9.96}{12.00}{%
 corresponding class attribute.%
 }
 \HLAFixedBlock{100.025}{486.779}{421.975}{\rmfamily\raggedright}{9.96}{12.00}{%
 s)%
 }
 \HLAFixedBlock{121.969}{486.779}{400.031}{\rmfamily\raggedright}{9.96}{12.00}{%
 An update to an instance attribute by the joined federate that owns that instance attribute shall be%
 }
 \HLAFixedBlock{121.985}{498.779}{400.015}{\rmfamily\raggedright}{9.96}{12.00}{%
 reflected only by other joined federates that are subscribed to the instance attribute’s corresponding%
 }
 \HLAFixedBlock{121.985}{510.779}{400.015}{\rmfamily\raggedright}{9.96}{12.00}{%
 (from each subscriber’s perspective) class attribute.%
 }
 \HLAServiceComponentHeadingAt{534.639}{%
 5.1.3 Definitions and constraints for interaction classes and parameters%
 }
 \HLAFixedBlock{90.005}{558.778}{431.995}{\rmfamily\raggedright}{9.96}{12.00}{%
 The following DM definitions and constraints shall pertain to interaction classes and parameters as declared%
 }
 \HLAFixedBlock{90.005}{570.778}{431.995}{\rmfamily\raggedright}{9.96}{12.00}{%
 in the interaction class hierarchy of the FDD:%
 }
 \HLAFixedBlock{100.025}{582.778}{421.975}{\rmfamily\raggedright}{9.96}{12.00}{%
 a)%
 }
 \HLAFixedBlock{121.987}{582.778}{400.013}{\rmfamily\raggedright}{9.96}{12.00}{%
 From a joined federate’s perspective, an interaction class shall be \textbf{subscribed} if and only if it was an%
 }
 \HLAFixedBlock{121.985}{594.777}{400.015}{\rmfamily\raggedright}{9.96}{12.00}{%
 argument to a \emph{Subscribe Interaction Class }service invocation by that joined federate that was not%
