 c)%
 }
 \HLAFixedBlock{121.979}{654.785}{400.021}{\rmfamily\raggedright}{9.96}{12.00}{%
 From a joined federate’s perspective, an interaction class shall be \textbf{published} if and only if it was an%
 }
 \HLAFixedBlock{121.980}{666.785}{400.020}{\rmfamily\raggedright}{9.96}{12.00}{%
 argument to a \emph{Publish Interaction Class }service invocation by that joined federate that was not%
 }
 \HLAFixedBlock{121.979}{678.785}{400.021}{\rmfamily\raggedright}{9.96}{12.00}{%
 subsequently followed by an \emph{Unpublish Interaction Class} service invocation for that interaction%
 }
 \HLAFixedBlock{121.979}{690.785}{400.021}{\rmfamily\raggedright}{9.96}{12.00}{%
 class.%
 }
