 }
 \HLAFixedBlock{121.933}{561.778}{400.067}{\rmfamily\raggedright}{9.96}{12.00}{%
 From a joined federate’s perspective, the \textbf{subscribed} directed interaction classes of an object class%
 }
 \HLAFixedBlock{121.977}{573.778}{400.023}{\rmfamily\raggedright}{9.96}{12.00}{%
