 \HLAServiceHeadingAt{207.383}{%
 5.8 \emph{Subscribe Object Class Attributes} service%
 }
 \HLAFixedBlock{90.000}{232.806}{432.000}{\rmfamily\raggedright}{9.96}{12.00}{%
 The \emph{Subscribe Object Class Attributes} service shall specify an object class at which the RTI shall notify the%
 }
 \HLAFixedBlock{90.001}{244.805}{431.999}{\rmfamily\raggedright}{9.96}{12.00}{%
 joined federate of discovery of object instances. When subscribing to an object class, the joined federate%
 }
 \HLAFixedBlock{90.001}{256.805}{431.999}{\rmfamily\raggedright}{9.96}{12.00}{%
 shall also provide a set of class attributes. The values of only the instance attributes that correspond to the%
 }
 \HLAFixedBlock{90.001}{268.805}{431.999}{\rmfamily\raggedright}{9.96}{12.00}{%
 specified class attributes, for all object instances discovered as a result of this service invocation, shall be%
 }
 \HLAFixedBlock{90.001}{280.805}{431.999}{\rmfamily\raggedright}{9.96}{12.00}{%
 provided to the joined federate from the RTI (via the \emph{Reflect Attribute Values \textdagger{}} service). The set of class%
 }
 \HLAFixedBlock{90.001}{292.805}{431.999}{\rmfamily\raggedright}{9.96}{12.00}{%
 attributes provided shall be a subset of the available attributes of the specified object class. %
 }
 \HLAFixedBlock{90.001}{316.804}{431.999}{\rmfamily\raggedright}{9.96}{12.00}{%
 A joined federate shall discover an object instance only as being of a class to which the joined federate is%
 }
 \HLAFixedBlock{90.001}{328.804}{431.999}{\rmfamily\raggedright}{9.96}{12.00}{%
 subscribed. %
 }
 \HLAFixedBlock{90.001}{352.804}{431.999}{\rmfamily\raggedright}{9.96}{12.00}{%
 If a joined federate subscribes to multiple locations in an object class inheritance tree, each relevant object%
 }
 \HLAFixedBlock{90.001}{364.804}{431.999}{\rmfamily\raggedright}{9.96}{12.00}{%
 instance registration shall result in at most one object instance discovery by the subscribing joined federate.%
 }
 \HLAFixedBlock{90.001}{376.803}{431.999}{\rmfamily\raggedright}{9.96}{12.00}{%
 The discovered class shall be the registered class if subscribed by the discovering joined federate.%
 }
 \HLAFixedBlock{90.001}{388.803}{431.999}{\rmfamily\raggedright}{9.96}{12.00}{%
 Otherwise, the discovered class shall be the closest superclass of the registered class subscribed by the%
 }
 \HLAFixedBlock{90.001}{400.803}{431.999}{\rmfamily\raggedright}{9.96}{12.00}{%
 discovering joined federate.%
 }
 \HLAFixedBlock{90.001}{424.803}{431.999}{\rmfamily\raggedright}{9.96}{12.00}{%
 Each use of this service shall add to the subscriptions specified to the RTI in any previous \emph{Subscribe Object}%
 }
 \HLAFixedBlock{90.001}{436.802}{431.999}{\rmfamily\raggedright}{9.96}{12.00}{%
 \emph{Class Attributes} service invocation for the same object class. Invoking this service with an empty set of class%
 }
 \HLAFixedBlock{90.001}{448.802}{431.999}{\rmfamily\raggedright}{9.96}{12.00}{%
 attributes shall be equivalent to adding no subscriptions for the specified object class.%
 }
 \HLAFixedBlock{90.001}{472.802}{431.999}{\rmfamily\raggedright}{9.96}{12.00}{%
 The use of the optional passive subscription indicator shall act as follows:%
 }
 \HLAFixedBlock{90.001}{496.801}{431.999}{\rmfamily\raggedright}{9.96}{12.00}{%
 Each subscribed class attribute is subscribed either actively or passively (but not both actively and passively)%
 }
 \HLAFixedBlock{90.002}{508.801}{431.998}{\rmfamily\raggedright}{9.96}{12.00}{%
 at a given object class; and two class attributes that are subscribed at the same object class may be%
 }
 \HLAFixedBlock{90.001}{520.801}{431.999}{\rmfamily\raggedright}{9.96}{12.00}{%
 subscribed differently from each other: one active and one passive. Each class attribute specified in a given%
 }
 \HLAFixedBlock{90.002}{532.801}{431.998}{\rmfamily\raggedright}{9.96}{12.00}{%
 invocation of the \emph{Subscribe Object Class Attributes} service shall take on the effect of the optional passive/%
 }
 \HLAFixedBlock{90.001}{544.801}{431.999}{\rmfamily\raggedright}{9.96}{12.00}{%
 active subscription indicator supplied (or not supplied) with that service invocation. Invoking the \emph{Subscribe}%
 }
 \HLAFixedBlock{90.001}{556.800}{431.999}{\rmfamily\raggedright}{9.96}{12.00}{%
 \emph{Object Class Attributes} service with an empty set of class attributes shall not change the active/passive%
 }
 \HLAFixedBlock{90.002}{568.800}{431.998}{\rmfamily\raggedright}{9.96}{12.00}{%
 subscription nature of any of the attributes that are subscribed at the specified object class. Each use of the%
 }
 \HLAFixedBlock{90.002}{580.800}{431.998}{\rmfamily\raggedright}{9.96}{12.00}{%
 \emph{Subscribe Object Class Attributes} service shall add to the subscriptions specified to the RTI in any previous%
 }
 \HLAFixedBlock{90.002}{592.800}{431.998}{\rmfamily\raggedright}{9.96}{12.00}{%
 \emph{Subscribe Object Class Attributes} service invocation for the same object class and may change the active/%
 }
 \HLAFixedBlock{90.002}{604.800}{431.998}{\rmfamily\raggedright}{9.96}{12.00}{%
 passive nature of previous class attribute subscriptions for that object class.%
 }
 \HLAFixedBlock{90.002}{628.799}{431.998}{\rmfamily\raggedright}{9.96}{12.00}{%
 If the optional passive subscription indicator argument indicates that this is a passive subscription:%
 }
 \HLAFixedBlock{100.022}{640.799}{421.978}{\rmfamily\raggedright}{9.96}{12.00}{%
 a)%
 }
 \HLAFixedBlock{121.978}{640.799}{400.022}{\rmfamily\raggedright}{9.96}{12.00}{%
 The invocation of this service shall not cause the \emph{Start Registration For Object Class \textdagger{}} service to be%
 }
 \HLAFixedBlock{121.983}{652.799}{400.017}{\rmfamily\raggedright}{9.96}{12.00}{%
 invoked at any other joined federate, and %
 }
 \HLAFixedBlock{100.023}{664.799}{421.977}{\rmfamily\raggedright}{9.96}{12.00}{%
 b)%
 }
 \HLAFixedBlock{121.946}{664.799}{400.054}{\rmfamily\raggedright}{9.96}{12.00}{%
 If this invocation replaces a previous subscription that was active rather than passive, invocation of%
 }
 \HLAFixedBlock{121.983}{676.799}{400.017}{\rmfamily\raggedright}{9.96}{12.00}{%
 this service may cause the \emph{Stop Registration For Object Class \textdagger{}} service to be invoked at one or more%
 }
 \HLAFixedBlock{121.983}{688.798}{400.017}{\rmfamily\raggedright}{9.96}{12.00}{%
 other joined federates, depending on the joined federate’s publishing status.%
 }
\end{hlafixedpage}
