 \HLAServiceHeadingAt{267.383}{%
 5.10 \emph{Subscribe Interaction Class} service%
 }
 \HLAFixedBlock{90.000}{292.806}{432.000}{\rmfamily\raggedright}{9.96}{12.00}{%
 The \emph{Subscribe Interaction Class} service specifies an interaction class for which the RTI shall notify the%
 }
 \HLAFixedBlock{90.000}{304.805}{432.000}{\rmfamily\raggedright}{9.96}{12.00}{%
 joined federate of sent interactions by invoking the \emph{Receive Interaction \textdagger{}} service at the joined federate.%
 }
 \HLAFixedBlock{89.999}{328.805}{432.001}{\rmfamily\raggedright}{9.96}{12.00}{%
 When an interaction is received by a joined federate, the received class of the interaction shall be the%
 }
 \HLAFixedBlock{89.998}{340.805}{432.002}{\rmfamily\raggedright}{9.96}{12.00}{%
 interaction’s sent class, if subscribed. Otherwise, the received class is the closest superclass of the sent class%
 }
 \HLAFixedBlock{89.998}{352.805}{432.002}{\rmfamily\raggedright}{9.96}{12.00}{%
 that is subscribed when the interaction is received. Only the parameters from the interaction’s received class%
 }
 \HLAFixedBlock{89.997}{364.805}{432.003}{\rmfamily\raggedright}{9.96}{12.00}{%
 and its superclasses will be received.%
 }
 \HLAFixedBlock{89.997}{388.804}{432.003}{\rmfamily\raggedright}{9.96}{12.00}{%
 If a joined federate subscribes to multiple locations in an interaction class inheritance tree, each relevant%
 }
 \HLAFixedBlock{89.997}{400.804}{432.003}{\rmfamily\raggedright}{9.96}{12.00}{%
 interaction sent shall result in at most one received interaction in the subscribing joined federate.%
 }
 \HLAFixedBlock{89.997}{424.804}{432.003}{\rmfamily\raggedright}{9.96}{12.00}{%
 If the optional passive subscription indicator indicates that this is a passive subscription state:%
 }
 \HLAFixedBlock{100.017}{436.803}{421.983}{\rmfamily\raggedright}{9.96}{12.00}{%
 a)%
 }
 \HLAFixedBlock{121.975}{436.803}{400.025}{\rmfamily\raggedright}{9.96}{12.00}{%
 The invocation of this service shall not cause the \emph{Turn Interactions On \textdagger{}} service to be invoked at any%
 }
 \HLAFixedBlock{121.978}{448.803}{400.022}{\rmfamily\raggedright}{9.96}{12.00}{%
 other joined federate, and%
 }
 \HLAFixedBlock{100.018}{460.803}{421.982}{\rmfamily\raggedright}{9.96}{12.00}{%
 b)%
 }
 \HLAFixedBlock{121.941}{460.803}{400.059}{\rmfamily\raggedright}{9.96}{12.00}{%
 If this invocation replaces a previous subscription that was active rather than passive, invocation of%
 }
 \HLAFixedBlock{121.978}{472.803}{400.022}{\rmfamily\raggedright}{9.96}{12.00}{%
 this service may cause the \emph{Turn Interactions Off \textdagger{}} service to be invoked at one or more other joined%
 }
 \HLAFixedBlock{121.978}{484.803}{400.022}{\rmfamily\raggedright}{9.96}{12.00}{%
 federates, depending on the joined federate’s publishing status.%
 }
 \HLAFixedBlock{89.998}{508.802}{432.002}{\rmfamily\raggedright}{9.96}{12.00}{%
 If the optional passive subscription indicator is not present or indicates that this is an active subscription, the%
 }
 \HLAFixedBlock{89.998}{520.802}{432.002}{\rmfamily\raggedright}{9.96}{12.00}{%
 invocation of this service may cause the \emph{Turn Interactions On \textdagger{}} service to be invoked at one or more other%
 }
 \HLAFixedBlock{89.998}{532.802}{432.002}{\rmfamily\raggedright}{9.96}{12.00}{%
 joined federates.%
 }
 \HLAFixedBlock{89.998}{556.801}{432.002}{\rmfamily\raggedright}{9.96}{12.00}{%
 If a joined federate has the Service Reporting Switch Enabled, that joined federate shall not be able to%
 }
 \HLAFixedBlock{89.998}{568.801}{432.002}{\rmfamily\raggedright}{9.96}{12.00}{%
 subscribe to the HLAmanager.HLAfederate.HLAreport.HLAreportServiceInvocation interaction class.%
 }
