 5.12 Subscribe Object Class Directed Interactions service%
 }
 \HLAFixedBlock{90.000}{304.806}{432.000}{\rmfamily\raggedright}{9.96}{12.00}{%
 The \emph{Subscribe Object Class Directed Interactions} specifies directed interactions for an object class for%
 }
 \HLAFixedBlock{90.000}{316.805}{432.000}{\rmfamily\raggedright}{9.96}{12.00}{%
 which the RTI shall notify the joined federate of sent directed interactions by invoking the \emph{Receive Directed}%
 }
 \HLAFixedBlock{90.000}{328.805}{432.000}{\rmfamily\raggedright}{9.96}{12.00}{%
 \emph{Interaction \textdagger{}} service at the joined federate. The set of class directed interactions provided shall be a subset%
 }
 \HLAFixedBlock{90.000}{340.805}{432.000}{\rmfamily\raggedright}{9.96}{12.00}{%
 of the available directed interactions of the specified object class.%
 }
 \HLAFixedBlock{90.000}{364.805}{432.000}{\rmfamily\raggedright}{9.96}{12.00}{%
 Directed interaction classes are subscribed by ownership or universally:%
 }
 \HLAFixedBlock{100.020}{376.805}{421.980}{\rmfamily\raggedright}{9.96}{12.00}{%
 a)%
 }
 \HLAFixedBlock{121.964}{376.805}{400.036}{\rmfamily\raggedright}{9.96}{12.00}{%
 If the optional universal subscription indicator is not present or indicates subscription by ownership,%
 }
 \HLAFixedBlock{121.980}{388.804}{400.020}{\rmfamily\raggedright}{9.96}{12.00}{%
 directed interactions are only delivered for target object instances for which the joined federate owns%
 }
 \HLAFixedBlock{121.980}{400.804}{400.020}{\rmfamily\raggedright}{9.96}{12.00}{%
 at least one attribute.%
 }
 \HLAFixedBlock{100.020}{412.804}{421.980}{\rmfamily\raggedright}{9.96}{12.00}{%
 b)%
 }
 \HLAFixedBlock{121.980}{412.804}{400.020}{\rmfamily\raggedright}{9.96}{12.00}{%
 If the optional universal subscription indicator indicates universal subscription, directed interactions%
 }
 \HLAFixedBlock{121.980}{424.804}{400.020}{\rmfamily\raggedright}{9.96}{12.00}{%
 are delivered for all object instances that are known to the joined federate.%
 }
 \HLAFixedBlock{89.999}{448.803}{432.001}{\rmfamily\raggedright}{9.96}{12.00}{%
 The use of the optional universal subscription indicator shall act as follows:%
 }
 \HLAFixedBlock{89.999}{472.803}{432.001}{\rmfamily\raggedright}{9.96}{12.00}{%
 Each subscribed directed interaction class is subscribed either by ownership or universally (but not both) at a%
 }
 \HLAFixedBlock{89.999}{484.803}{432.001}{\rmfamily\raggedright}{9.96}{12.00}{%
 given object class; and two directed interaction classes that are subscribed at the same object class may be%
 }
 \HLAFixedBlock{89.999}{496.803}{432.001}{\rmfamily\raggedright}{9.96}{12.00}{%
 subscribed differently from each other: one by ownership and one universal. Each directed interaction class%
 }
 \HLAFixedBlock{89.999}{508.802}{432.001}{\rmfamily\raggedright}{9.96}{12.00}{%
 specified in a given invocation of the \emph{Subscribe Object Class Directed Interactions} service shall take on the%
 }
 \HLAFixedBlock{89.999}{520.802}{432.001}{\rmfamily\raggedright}{9.96}{12.00}{%
 effect of the optional by ownership/universal subscription indicator supplied (or not supplied) with that%
 }
 \HLAFixedBlock{89.999}{532.802}{432.001}{\rmfamily\raggedright}{9.96}{12.00}{%
 service invocation. %
 }
 \HLAFixedBlock{89.999}{556.802}{432.001}{\rmfamily\raggedright}{9.96}{12.00}{%
 Invoking the Subscribe Object Class Directed Interactions service with an empty set of directed interaction%
 }
 \HLAFixedBlock{89.999}{568.801}{432.001}{\rmfamily\raggedright}{9.96}{12.00}{%
 classes shall not change the by ownership/universal subscription nature of any of the directed interactions%
 }
 \HLAFixedBlock{89.999}{580.801}{432.001}{\rmfamily\raggedright}{9.96}{12.00}{%
 that are subscribed at the specified object class. Each use of the \emph{Subscribe Object Class Directed}%
 }
 \HLAFixedBlock{89.999}{592.801}{432.001}{\rmfamily\raggedright}{9.96}{12.00}{%
 \emph{Interactions} service shall add to the subscriptions specified to the RTI in any previous \emph{Subscribe Object}%
 }
 \HLAFixedBlock{89.999}{604.801}{432.001}{\rmfamily\raggedright}{9.96}{12.00}{%
 \emph{Class Directed Interactions} service invocation for the same object class and may change the by ownership/%
 }
 \HLAFixedBlock{90.000}{616.801}{432.000}{\rmfamily\raggedright}{9.96}{12.00}{%
 universal nature of previous directed interaction subscriptions for that object class.%
 }
 \HLAFixedBlock{90.000}{640.800}{432.000}{\rmfamily\raggedright}{9.96}{12.00}{%
 When a directed interaction is received by a joined federate, the received class of the interaction shall be the%
 }
 \HLAFixedBlock{90.000}{652.800}{432.000}{\rmfamily\raggedright}{9.96}{12.00}{%
 directed interaction’s sent class, if subscribed. Otherwise, the received class is the closest superclass of the%
 }
 \HLAFixedBlock{90.000}{664.800}{432.000}{\rmfamily\raggedright}{9.96}{12.00}{%
 sent class that is subscribed when the directed interaction is received. Only the parameters from the directed%
 }
 \HLAFixedBlock{90.000}{676.800}{432.000}{\rmfamily\raggedright}{9.96}{12.00}{%
 interaction’s received class and its superclasses will be received.%
 }
\end{hlafixedpage}
