 \HLAFigureImageAt{118.259}{354.420}{375.482}{309.720}{assets/extracted/source-p111-xref13886.png}
 \HLAFixedBlock{90.000}{69.786}{432.000}{\rmfamily\raggedright}{9.96}{12.00}{%
 value is specified for this switch, then the RTI will provide default values based on the switches table%
 }
 \HLAFixedBlock{90.000}{81.785}{432.000}{\rmfamily\raggedright}{9.96}{12.00}{%
 defaults table in IEEE Std 1516.2-2025. This switch setting shall be modifiable during a federation%
 }
 \HLAFixedBlock{90.000}{93.785}{432.000}{\rmfamily\raggedright}{9.96}{12.00}{%
 execution via the HLAmanager{\fontsize{9.00pt}{10.50pt}\selectfont .}HLAfederation.HLAadjust.HLAsetSwitches MOM interaction.%
 }
 \HLAFixedBlock{90.000}{117.785}{432.000}{\rmfamily\raggedright}{9.96}{12.00}{%
 Whenever this switch is enabled, the \emph{Provide Attribute Value Update \textdagger{}} service shall be invoked, at an%
 }
 \HLAFixedBlock{90.000}{129.785}{432.000}{\rmfamily\raggedright}{9.96}{12.00}{%
 instance attribute-owning federate, for every instance attribute in an execution, whenever it becomes in%
 }
 \HLAFixedBlock{90.000}{141.785}{432.000}{\rmfamily\raggedright}{9.96}{12.00}{%
 scope at another non-owning federate. If an instance attribute becomes in scope at multiple federates at the%
 }
 \HLAFixedBlock{90.000}{153.785}{432.000}{\rmfamily\raggedright}{9.96}{12.00}{%
 same wall-clock time, the \emph{Provide Attribute Value Update \textdagger{}} service may be invoked at the owning federate%
 }
 \HLAFixedBlock{90.000}{165.785}{432.000}{\rmfamily\raggedright}{9.96}{12.00}{%
 just once, rather than once for each federate at which the instance attribute became in scope.%
 }
 \HLAFixedBlock{90.000}{189.784}{432.000}{\rmfamily\raggedright}{9.96}{12.00}{%
 When this switch changes to enabled during a federation execution, the \emph{Provide Attribute Value Update \textdagger{}}%
 }
 \HLAFixedBlock{90.000}{201.784}{432.000}{\rmfamily\raggedright}{9.96}{12.00}{%
 service shall be invoked at the appropriate owning federate for every in-scope instance attribute.%
 }
 \HLAFixedBlock{90.000}{225.784}{432.000}{\rmfamily\raggedright}{9.96}{12.00}{%
 This switch relies on the definition of in-scope attributes, not on the setting of the Attribute Scope Advisory%
 }
 \HLAFixedBlock{90.000}{237.783}{432.000}{\rmfamily\raggedright}{9.96}{12.00}{%
 Switch. The Auto-Provide Switch shall function the same whether the Attribute Scope Advisory Switch is%
 }
 \HLAFixedBlock{90.000}{249.783}{432.000}{\rmfamily\raggedright}{9.96}{12.00}{%
 enabled or disabled.%
 }
