 }
 \HLAFixedBlock{90.000}{334.806}{432.000}{\rmfamily\raggedright}{9.96}{12.00}{%
 The \emph{Multiple Object Instance Names Reserved} \textdagger{}\emph{ }service notifies the joined federate whether the names%
 }
 \HLAFixedBlock{90.001}{346.805}{431.999}{\rmfamily\raggedright}{9.96}{12.00}{%
 provided in a previous invocation of \emph{Reserve Multiple Object Instance Names} service have been reserved. If%
 }
 \HLAFixedBlock{90.001}{358.805}{431.999}{\rmfamily\raggedright}{9.96}{12.00}{%
 successful, this reservation shall mean that the joined federate has obtained the unique right to register object%
 }
 \HLAFixedBlock{90.001}{370.805}{431.999}{\rmfamily\raggedright}{9.96}{12.00}{%
 instances with the supplied names. The reservation is retained until the joined federate either resigns or%
 }
 \HLAFixedBlock{90.001}{382.805}{431.999}{\rmfamily\raggedright}{9.96}{12.00}{%
 relinquishes the reservation by successfully invoking the \emph{Release Object Instance Name} or \emph{Release Multiple}%
 }
 \HLAFixedBlock{90.001}{394.805}{431.999}{\rmfamily\raggedright}{9.96}{12.00}{%
 \emph{Object Instance Names} service. While a joined federate holds a reservation on a name, no other federate%
 }
 \HLAFixedBlock{90.001}{406.805}{431.999}{\rmfamily\raggedright}{9.96}{12.00}{%
 joined to the current federation execution shall receive a successful reservation for that name. This service%
 }
 \HLAFixedBlock{90.001}{418.804}{431.999}{\rmfamily\raggedright}{9.96}{12.00}{%
 shall not be invoked as a result of the \emph{Reserve Object Instance Name} service.%
 }
