 6.10 \emph{Update Attribute Values} service%
 }
 \HLAFixedBlock{90.000}{379.806}{432.000}{\rmfamily\raggedright}{9.96}{12.00}{%
 The \emph{Update Attribute Values} service shall provide instance attribute values to the federation. The joined%
 }
 \HLAFixedBlock{90.000}{391.805}{432.000}{\rmfamily\raggedright}{9.96}{12.00}{%
 federate shall be able to update only owned instance attributes. The joined federate should supply instance%
 }
 \HLAFixedBlock{90.000}{403.805}{432.000}{\rmfamily\raggedright}{9.96}{12.00}{%
 attribute values using the federation-agreed-upon update policies. This service, coupled with the \emph{Reflect}%
 }
 \HLAFixedBlock{89.999}{415.805}{432.001}{\rmfamily\raggedright}{9.96}{12.00}{%
 \emph{Attribute Values \textdagger{}} service, forms the primary data exchange mechanism supported by the RTI.%
 }
 \HLAFixedBlock{89.999}{439.805}{432.001}{\rmfamily\raggedright}{9.96}{12.00}{%
 If preferred order type (see 8.1.3) of at least one instance attribute is TSO, the joined federate invoking this%
 }
 \HLAFixedBlock{89.999}{451.805}{432.001}{\rmfamily\raggedright}{9.96}{12.00}{%
 service is time-regulating, and the timestamp argument is present, this service shall return a%
 }
 \HLAFixedBlock{89.999}{463.804}{432.001}{\rmfamily\raggedright}{9.96}{12.00}{%
 federation-unique message retraction designator. Otherwise, no message retraction designator shall be%
 }
 \HLAFixedBlock{89.999}{475.804}{432.001}{\rmfamily\raggedright}{9.96}{12.00}{%
 returned. A timestamp value should be provided if the preferred order type of at least one instance attribute%
 }
 \HLAFixedBlock{89.999}{487.804}{432.001}{\rmfamily\raggedright}{9.96}{12.00}{%
 is TSO and the joined federate invoking this service is time-regulating.%
 }
 \HLAFixedBlock{89.999}{511.804}{432.001}{\rmfamily\raggedright}{9.96}{12.00}{%
 The user-supplied tag argument shall be provided with all corresponding \emph{Reflect Attribute Value \textdagger{} }service%
 }
 \HLAFixedBlock{89.999}{523.803}{432.001}{\rmfamily\raggedright}{9.96}{12.00}{%
 invocations, even multiple ones at the same reflecting joined federate.%
 }
 \HLAFixedBlock{89.999}{547.803}{432.001}{\rmfamily\raggedright}{9.96}{12.00}{%
 If, at any wall-clock time between the invocation of this service and what would be the invocation of the%
 }
 \HLAFixedBlock{89.999}{559.803}{432.001}{\rmfamily\raggedright}{9.96}{12.00}{%
 corresponding \emph{Reflect Attribute Values \textdagger{}} service for a given instance attribute that is supplied as an%
 }
 \HLAFixedBlock{89.999}{571.803}{432.001}{\rmfamily\raggedright}{9.96}{12.00}{%
 argument to this service, a potential joined federate is either%
 }
 \HLAFixedBlock{100.019}{586.802}{421.981}{\rmfamily\raggedright}{9.96}{12.00}{%
 a)%
 }
 \HLAFixedBlock{121.978}{586.802}{400.022}{\rmfamily\raggedright}{9.96}{12.00}{%
 Unsubscribed to that instance attribute’s corresponding class attribute at the known class of the%
 }
 \HLAFixedBlock{121.980}{598.802}{400.020}{\rmfamily\raggedright}{9.96}{12.00}{%
 object instance at the potential reflecting joined federate, or%
 }
 \HLAFixedBlock{100.019}{613.802}{421.981}{\rmfamily\raggedright}{9.96}{12.00}{%
 b)%
 }
 \HLAFixedBlock{121.979}{613.802}{400.021}{\rmfamily\raggedright}{9.96}{12.00}{%
 Using a subscription region set for the instance attribute’s corresponding class attribute at the known%
 }
 \HLAFixedBlock{121.979}{625.802}{400.021}{\rmfamily\raggedright}{9.96}{12.00}{%
 class of the object instance at the potential reflecting joined federate and this region set does not%
 }
 \HLAFixedBlock{121.979}{637.802}{400.021}{\rmfamily\raggedright}{9.96}{12.00}{%
 overlap the update region set of the instance attribute at the wall-clock time of update, then the RTI%
 }
 \HLAFixedBlock{121.978}{649.801}{400.022}{\rmfamily\raggedright}{9.96}{12.00}{%
 shall not invoke the corresponding \emph{Reflect Attribute Values \textdagger{}} service for that instance attribute at that%
 }
 \HLAFixedBlock{121.979}{661.801}{400.021}{\rmfamily\raggedright}{9.96}{12.00}{%
 joined federate.%
 }
\end{hlafixedpage}
