 \HLAFixedBlock{90.000}{580.806}{432.000}{\rmfamily\raggedright}{9.96}{12.00}{%
 The \emph{Send Interaction} service shall send an interaction into the federation. Only parameters that are available%
 }
 \HLAFixedBlock{90.000}{592.805}{432.000}{\rmfamily\raggedright}{9.96}{12.00}{%
 at the specified interaction class may be sent in a given interaction, as defined in the FDD. A federate is not%
 }
 \HLAFixedBlock{90.000}{604.805}{432.000}{\rmfamily\raggedright}{9.96}{12.00}{%
 required to send all available parameters of the interaction class with the interaction.%
 }
 \HLAFixedBlock{90.000}{628.805}{432.000}{\rmfamily\raggedright}{9.96}{12.00}{%
 If preferred order type (see 8.1.3) of the interaction is TSO, the joined federate invoking this service is%
 }
 \HLAFixedBlock{90.000}{640.805}{432.000}{\rmfamily\raggedright}{9.96}{12.00}{%
 time-regulating, and the timestamp argument is present, this service shall return a federation-unique%
 }
 \HLAFixedBlock{90.000}{652.804}{432.000}{\rmfamily\raggedright}{9.96}{12.00}{%
 message retraction designator. Otherwise, no message retraction designator shall be returned. A timestamp%
 }
 \HLAFixedBlock{90.000}{664.804}{432.000}{\rmfamily\raggedright}{9.96}{12.00}{%
 value should be provided if the preferred order type of the interaction is TSO and the joined federate%
 }
 \HLAFixedBlock{90.000}{676.804}{432.000}{\rmfamily\raggedright}{9.96}{12.00}{%
 invoking this service is time-regulating.%
 }
