 \HLAFixedBlock{90.000}{640.806}{432.000}{\rmfamily\raggedright}{9.96}{12.00}{%
 The \emph{Send Directed Interaction} service shall send a directed interaction into the federation. Only parameters%
 }
 \HLAFixedBlock{90.000}{652.805}{432.000}{\rmfamily\raggedright}{9.96}{12.00}{%
 that are available at the specified interaction class may be sent in a given interaction, as defined in the FDD.%
 }
 \HLAFixedBlock{90.000}{664.805}{432.000}{\rmfamily\raggedright}{9.96}{12.00}{%
 A federate is not required to send all available parameters of the interaction class with the interaction.%
 }
 \HLAFixedBlock{90.000}{688.805}{432.000}{\rmfamily\raggedright}{9.96}{12.00}{%
 If preferred order type (see 8.1.3) of the interaction is TSO, the joined federate invoking this service is time-%
 }
 \HLAFixedBlock{90.000}{700.805}{432.000}{\rmfamily\raggedright}{9.96}{12.00}{%
 regulating, and the timestamp argument is present, this service shall return a federation-unique message%
 }
