 \HLAFixedBlock{90.000}{69.786}{432.000}{\rmfamily\raggedright}{9.96}{12.00}{%
 retraction designator. Otherwise, no message retraction designator shall be returned. A timestamp value%
 }
 \HLAFixedBlock{90.000}{81.785}{432.000}{\rmfamily\raggedright}{9.96}{12.00}{%
 should be provided if the preferred order type of the interaction is TSO and the joined federate invoking this%
 }
 \HLAFixedBlock{90.000}{93.785}{432.000}{\rmfamily\raggedright}{9.96}{12.00}{%
 service is time-regulating. %
 }
 \HLAFixedBlock{90.000}{117.785}{432.000}{\rmfamily\raggedright}{9.96}{12.00}{%
 If, at any wall-clock time between the invocation of this service for a particular interaction class argument%
 }
 \HLAFixedBlock{90.000}{129.785}{432.000}{\rmfamily\raggedright}{9.96}{12.00}{%
 and what would be the invocation of the corresponding \emph{Receive Directed Interaction \textdagger{}} service at a potential%
 }
 \HLAFixedBlock{90.000}{141.785}{432.000}{\rmfamily\raggedright}{9.96}{12.00}{%
 receiving joined federate, the potential receiving joined federate is unsubscribed to the specified interaction%
 }
 \HLAFixedBlock{89.999}{153.784}{432.001}{\rmfamily\raggedright}{9.96}{12.00}{%
 class, the RTI shall not invoke the corresponding \emph{Receive Directed Interaction \textdagger{}} service at that joined%
 }
 \HLAFixedBlock{89.999}{165.784}{432.001}{\rmfamily\raggedright}{9.96}{12.00}{%
 federate. If, at any wall-clock time between the invocation of this service for a particular interaction class%
 }
 \HLAFixedBlock{89.999}{177.784}{432.001}{\rmfamily\raggedright}{9.96}{12.00}{%
 and what would be the invocation of the corresponding \emph{Receive Directed Interaction \textdagger{}} service at a potential%
 }
 \HLAFixedBlock{89.999}{189.784}{432.001}{\rmfamily\raggedright}{9.96}{12.00}{%
 receiving joined federate, the potential receiving joined federate is subscribed to the specified interaction%
 }
 \HLAFixedBlock{89.998}{201.784}{432.002}{\rmfamily\raggedright}{9.96}{12.00}{%
 class, then the RTI shall invoke the corresponding \emph{Receive Directed Interaction \textdagger{}} service at that joined%
 }
 \HLAFixedBlock{89.998}{213.783}{432.002}{\rmfamily\raggedright}{9.96}{12.00}{%
 federate, subject to the preconditions of the \emph{Receive Directed Interaction \textdagger{}} service and the rules of time%
 }
 \HLAFixedBlock{89.997}{225.783}{432.003}{\rmfamily\raggedright}{9.96}{12.00}{%
 management.%
 }
 \HLAFixedBlock{89.997}{249.783}{432.003}{\rmfamily\raggedright}{9.96}{12.00}{%
 A joined federate invoking the \emph{Send Directed Interaction} service shall not receive the induced \emph{Receive}%
 }
 \HLAFixedBlock{89.998}{261.783}{432.002}{\rmfamily\raggedright}{9.96}{12.00}{%
 \emph{Directed Interaction \textdagger{}} service invocation, regardless of the subscription situation.%
 }
 \HLAFixedBlock{89.998}{285.782}{432.002}{\rmfamily\raggedright}{9.96}{12.00}{%
