 6.15 \emph{Receive Directed Interaction \textdagger{}} service%
 }
 \HLAFixedBlock{90.000}{331.806}{432.000}{\rmfamily\raggedright}{9.96}{12.00}{%
 The \emph{Receive Directed Interaction \textdagger{}} service shall provide the joined federate with a sent directed interaction.%
 }
 \HLAFixedBlock{90.001}{355.805}{431.999}{\rmfamily\raggedright}{9.96}{12.00}{%
 The user-supplied tag argument supplied to the corresponding \emph{Send Directed Interaction} shall be provided%
 }
 \HLAFixedBlock{90.001}{367.805}{431.999}{\rmfamily\raggedright}{9.96}{12.00}{%
 with all corresponding \emph{Receive Directed Interaction \textdagger{}} service invocations.%
 }
 \HLAFixedBlock{90.001}{391.805}{431.999}{\rmfamily\raggedright}{9.96}{12.00}{%
 The transportation type argument shall indicate the transportation type of the specified interaction, i.e., the%
 }
 \HLAFixedBlock{90.001}{403.804}{431.999}{\rmfamily\raggedright}{9.96}{12.00}{%
 transportation type of the published interaction at the joined federate that invoked the corresponding \emph{Send}%
 }
 \HLAFixedBlock{90.001}{415.804}{431.999}{\rmfamily\raggedright}{9.96}{12.00}{%
 \emph{Directed Interaction service.}%
 }
 \HLAFixedBlock{90.001}{439.804}{431.999}{\rmfamily\raggedright}{9.96}{12.00}{%
 A timestamp shall be provided if one was specified in the corresponding \emph{Send Directed Interaction} service%
 }
 \HLAFixedBlock{90.001}{451.804}{431.999}{\rmfamily\raggedright}{9.96}{12.00}{%
 invocation. The receive message order type shall indicate the type (either RO or TSO) of the received%
 }
 \HLAFixedBlock{90.001}{463.804}{431.999}{\rmfamily\raggedright}{9.96}{12.00}{%
 message. The timestamp and receive message order type arguments shall be supplied together or not at all.%
 }
 \HLAFixedBlock{90.002}{475.803}{431.998}{\rmfamily\raggedright}{9.96}{12.00}{%
 The sent message order type shall indicate the type (either RO or TSO) of the sent message.%
 }
 \HLAFixedBlock{90.002}{499.803}{431.998}{\rmfamily\raggedright}{9.96}{12.00}{%
 A retraction handle shall be provided if and only if the sent message order type is TSO.%
 }
 \HLAFixedBlock{90.002}{523.802}{431.998}{\rmfamily\raggedright}{9.96}{12.00}{%
 The producing joined federate argument shall contain the designator for the sending joined federate.%
 }
 \HLAFixedBlock{90.002}{547.802}{431.998}{\rmfamily\raggedright}{9.96}{12.00}{%
 A joined federate invoking the \emph{Send Directed Interaction} shall not receive the induced \emph{Receive Directed}%
 }
 \HLAFixedBlock{90.002}{559.802}{431.998}{\rmfamily\raggedright}{9.96}{12.00}{%
 \emph{Interaction \textdagger{}} service invocation, regardless of the subscription situation.%
 }
 \HLAFixedBlock{90.002}{583.802}{431.998}{\rmfamily\raggedright}{9.96}{12.00}{%
 At most, one induced \emph{Receive Directed Interaction \textdagger{}} service invocation shall happen at a joined federate as%
 }
 \HLAFixedBlock{90.002}{595.801}{431.998}{\rmfamily\raggedright}{9.96}{12.00}{%
 a result of the invocation of the \emph{Send Directed Interaction} service at another joined federate.%
 }
