 }
 \HLAFixedBlock{90.000}{301.806}{432.000}{\rmfamily\raggedright}{9.96}{12.00}{%
 The \emph{Remove Object Instance \textdagger{} }service shall inform the joined federate that an object instance has been%
 }
 \HLAFixedBlock{90.000}{313.805}{432.000}{\rmfamily\raggedright}{9.96}{12.00}{%
 deleted from the federation execution.%
 }
 \HLAFixedBlock{90.000}{337.805}{432.000}{\rmfamily\raggedright}{9.96}{12.00}{%
 The user-supplied tag argument supplied to the corresponding \emph{Delete Object Instance} service invocation%
 }
 \HLAFixedBlock{90.000}{349.805}{432.000}{\rmfamily\raggedright}{9.96}{12.00}{%
 shall be provided with all corresponding \emph{Remove Object Instance \textdagger{}} service invocations.%
 }
 \HLAFixedBlock{90.000}{373.804}{432.000}{\rmfamily\raggedright}{9.96}{12.00}{%
 A timestamp shall be provided if one was specified in the corresponding \emph{Delete Object Instance} service%
 }
 \HLAFixedBlock{89.999}{385.804}{432.001}{\rmfamily\raggedright}{9.96}{12.00}{%
 invocation. The receive message order type shall indicate the type (either RO or TSO) of the received%
 }
 \HLAFixedBlock{89.999}{397.804}{432.001}{\rmfamily\raggedright}{9.96}{12.00}{%
 message. The timestamp and receive message order type arguments shall be supplied together or not at all.%
 }
 \HLAFixedBlock{90.000}{409.804}{432.000}{\rmfamily\raggedright}{9.96}{12.00}{%
 The sent message order type shall indicate the type (either RO or TSO) of the sent message. %
 }
 \HLAFixedBlock{90.000}{433.804}{432.000}{\rmfamily\raggedright}{9.96}{12.00}{%
 A retraction handle shall be provided if the delete message had a sent order type of TSO. Otherwise, no%
 }
 \HLAFixedBlock{90.000}{445.803}{432.000}{\rmfamily\raggedright}{9.96}{12.00}{%
 retraction handle shall be provided.%
 }
 \HLAFixedBlock{90.000}{469.803}{432.000}{\rmfamily\raggedright}{9.96}{12.00}{%
 The producing joined federate argument shall contain the designator for the joined federate that registered%
 }
 \HLAFixedBlock{90.000}{481.803}{432.000}{\rmfamily\raggedright}{9.96}{12.00}{%
 the object instance. This producing joined federate may not own instance attributes that caused the%
 }
 \HLAFixedBlock{90.000}{493.803}{432.000}{\rmfamily\raggedright}{9.96}{12.00}{%
 discovery, and, in fact, it may even no longer be joined to the federation execution.%
 }
 \HLAFixedBlock{90.000}{517.802}{432.000}{\rmfamily\raggedright}{9.96}{12.00}{%
 A joined federate invoking the \emph{Delete Object Instance }service shall not receive the induced \emph{Remove Object}%
 }
 \HLAFixedBlock{90.000}{529.802}{432.000}{\rmfamily\raggedright}{9.96}{12.00}{%
 \emph{Instance \textdagger{} }service invocation.%
 }
