 }
 \HLAFixedBlock{90.000}{589.805}{432.000}{\rmfamily\raggedright}{9.96}{12.00}{%
 as if the RTI had never notified the invoking joined federate to discover the object instance. The object%
 }
 \HLAFixedBlock{90.000}{601.805}{432.000}{\rmfamily\raggedright}{9.96}{12.00}{%
