 }
 \HLAFixedBlock{90.000}{634.805}{432.000}{\rmfamily\raggedright}{9.96}{12.00}{%
 \emph{Attribute Value Update \textdagger{} }service for unowned instance attributes. When an object class is specified, the RTI%
 }
 \HLAFixedBlock{90.000}{646.805}{432.000}{\rmfamily\raggedright}{9.96}{12.00}{%
 shall solicit the values of the specified instance attributes for all object instances registered at that class and%
 }
 \HLAFixedBlock{90.000}{658.805}{432.000}{\rmfamily\raggedright}{9.96}{12.00}{%
 all subclasses of that class. When an object instance designator is specified, the RTI shall solicit the values%
 }
 \HLAFixedBlock{90.000}{670.804}{432.000}{\rmfamily\raggedright}{9.96}{12.00}{%
