 }
 \HLAFixedBlock{89.999}{651.786}{432.001}{\rmfamily\raggedright}{9.96}{12.00}{%
 the specified attributes of the specified object instance are required somewhere in the federation execution.%
 }
 \HLAFixedBlock{90.000}{662.825}{432.000}{\rmfamily\raggedright}{9.96}{12.00}{%
 If the \emph{Advisories Use Known Class Switch} is disabled, an attribute may be indicated as required even if it%
 }
 \HLAFixedBlock{89.999}{673.805}{432.001}{\rmfamily\raggedright}{9.96}{12.00}{%
 will not be reflected. This depends on the known class of the instance at the subscribing federate. The update%
 }
 \HLAFixedBlock{89.999}{684.785}{432.001}{\rmfamily\raggedright}{9.96}{12.00}{%
 rate designator argument shall not be provided if there exists a subscription with the default, unspecified%
 }
 \HLAFixedBlock{89.999}{695.825}{432.001}{\rmfamily\raggedright}{9.96}{12.00}{%
 rate. If no such subscription exists, then the provided update rate designator argument shall be the update%
 }
 \HLAFixedBlock{89.999}{706.805}{432.001}{\rmfamily\raggedright}{9.96}{12.00}{%
 rate designator of the maximum subscribed rate.%
 }
