 6.27 \emph{Change Default Attribute Transportation Type }service%
 }
 \HLAFixedBlock{90.000}{553.806}{432.000}{\rmfamily\raggedright}{9.96}{12.00}{%
 Upon a federate gaining ownership of an instance attribute (either through registration or ownership%
 }
 \HLAFixedBlock{90.000}{565.805}{432.000}{\rmfamily\raggedright}{9.96}{12.00}{%
 transfer), the instance attribute's transportation type shall be initialized using the federate\textquotesingle{} corresponding%
 }
 \HLAFixedBlock{90.000}{577.805}{432.000}{\rmfamily\raggedright}{9.96}{12.00}{%
 class attribute default transportation type. For each federate when joining, a class attribute's default%
 }
 \HLAFixedBlock{90.001}{589.805}{431.999}{\rmfamily\raggedright}{9.96}{12.00}{%
 transportation type shall be initialized from the corresponding class attribute description in the current FDD.%
 }
 \HLAFixedBlock{90.001}{601.805}{431.999}{\rmfamily\raggedright}{9.96}{12.00}{%
 A joined federate during execution may choose to change its class attribute's default transportation type.%
 }
 \HLAFixedBlock{90.001}{613.805}{431.999}{\rmfamily\raggedright}{9.96}{12.00}{%
 When changing a default transportation type, a class attribute shall be specified using a class handle for%
 }
 \HLAFixedBlock{90.001}{625.804}{431.999}{\rmfamily\raggedright}{9.96}{12.00}{%
 which the class attribute is available along with the class attribute\textquotesingle{} handle. Invoking the Change Default%
 }
 \HLAFixedBlock{90.001}{637.804}{431.999}{\rmfamily\raggedright}{9.96}{12.00}{%
 Attribute Transportation Type service on a class attribute shall affect the transportation type of a federate\textquotesingle{}%
 }
 \HLAFixedBlock{90.001}{649.804}{431.999}{\rmfamily\raggedright}{9.96}{12.00}{%
 future instance attributes of the class attribute irrespective of the object class used in the invocation. Existing%
 }
 \HLAFixedBlock{90.002}{661.804}{431.998}{\rmfamily\raggedright}{9.96}{12.00}{%
 owned object instances will not change their current transportation type nor will the class attribute default%
 }
 \HLAFixedBlock{90.002}{673.804}{431.998}{\rmfamily\raggedright}{9.96}{12.00}{%
 transportation type of other federates. %
 }
\end{hlafixedpage}
\clearpage

