 \HLAFixedBlock{90.000}{69.120}{432.000}{\sffamily\bfseries\raggedright}{12.00}{14.00}{%
 \textbf{7. Ownership management}%
 }
 \HLAServiceHeadingAt{101.363}{%
 \textbf{7.1 Overview}%
 }
 \HLAFixedBlock{90.000}{126.786}{432.000}{\rmfamily\raggedright}{9.96}{12.00}{%
 Ownership management is used by joined federates and the RTI to transfer ownership of instance attributes%
 }
 \HLAFixedBlock{90.000}{138.785}{432.000}{\rmfamily\raggedright}{9.96}{12.00}{%
 among joined federates. The ability to transfer ownership of instance attributes among joined federates shall%
 }
 \HLAFixedBlock{90.000}{150.785}{432.000}{\rmfamily\raggedright}{9.96}{12.00}{%
 be required to support the cooperative modeling of a given object instance across a federation. Only the%
 }
 \HLAFixedBlock{90.000}{162.785}{432.000}{\rmfamily\raggedright}{9.96}{12.00}{%
 joined federate that owns an instance attribute shall%
 }
 \HLAFixedBlock{100.021}{177.785}{421.979}{\rmfamily\raggedright}{9.96}{12.00}{%
 ---%
 }
 \HLAFixedBlock{121.981}{177.785}{400.019}{\rmfamily\raggedright}{9.96}{12.00}{%
 Invoke the \emph{Update Attribute Values} service to provide a new value for that instance attribute%
 }
 \HLAFixedBlock{100.021}{192.785}{421.979}{\rmfamily\raggedright}{9.96}{12.00}{%
 ---%
 }
 \HLAFixedBlock{121.981}{192.785}{400.019}{\rmfamily\raggedright}{9.96}{12.00}{%
 Receive invocations of the \emph{Provide Attribute Value Update \textdagger{}} service for that instance attribute%
 }
 \HLAFixedBlock{100.021}{207.784}{421.979}{\rmfamily\raggedright}{9.96}{12.00}{%
 ---%
 }
 \HLAFixedBlock{121.981}{207.784}{400.019}{\rmfamily\raggedright}{9.96}{12.00}{%
 Receive invocations of the \emph{Turn Updates On For Object Instance \textdagger{}} and \emph{Turn Updates Off For}%
 }
 \HLAFixedBlock{121.981}{219.784}{400.019}{\rmfamily\raggedright}{9.96}{12.00}{%
 \emph{Object Instance \textdagger{}} services pertaining to that instance attribute%
 }
 \HLAFixedBlock{90.000}{243.784}{432.000}{\rmfamily\raggedright}{9.96}{12.00}{%
 Figure 16 depicts the ways that ownership of a single instance attribute may be established from the%
 }
 \HLAFixedBlock{90.000}{255.784}{432.000}{\rmfamily\raggedright}{9.96}{12.00}{%
 viewpoint of a given joined federate. This diagram is complete insofar as all transitions shown represent%
 }
 \HLAFixedBlock{90.000}{267.783}{432.000}{\rmfamily\raggedright}{9.96}{12.00}{%
 legal operations, and transitions that are not shown represent illegal operations. The RTI shall generate%
 }
 \HLAFixedBlock{90.000}{279.783}{432.000}{\rmfamily\raggedright}{9.96}{12.00}{%
 exceptions if illegal operations are invoked.%
 }
 \HLAFixedBlock{90.000}{303.783}{432.000}{\rmfamily\raggedright}{9.96}{12.00}{%
 An instance attribute shall not be owned by more than one joined federate, and an instance attribute may be%
 }
 \HLAFixedBlock{90.000}{315.783}{432.000}{\rmfamily\raggedright}{9.96}{12.00}{%
 unowned by all joined federates. The RTI shall be responsible for attempting to find an owner for instance%
 }
 \HLAFixedBlock{90.000}{327.782}{432.000}{\rmfamily\raggedright}{9.96}{12.00}{%
 attributes that are left unowned as a result of a joined federate resignation or unconditional divestiture. The%
 }
 \HLAFixedBlock{90.000}{339.782}{432.000}{\rmfamily\raggedright}{9.96}{12.00}{%
 RID provided to an RTI may allow the federation to control how often or for how long an RTI will attempt%
 }
 \HLAFixedBlock{90.000}{351.782}{432.000}{\rmfamily\raggedright}{9.96}{12.00}{%
 to find an owner for unowned instance attributes. The RTI shall invoke the \emph{Request Attribute Ownership}%
 }
 \HLAFixedBlock{90.000}{363.782}{432.000}{\rmfamily\raggedright}{9.96}{12.00}{%
 \emph{Assumption \textdagger{}} service once at each joined federate that is both eligible to own the instance attribute and%
 }
 \HLAFixedBlock{89.999}{375.782}{432.001}{\rmfamily\raggedright}{9.96}{12.00}{%
 eligible to receive a \emph{Request Attribute Ownership Assumption \textdagger{}} service invocation for that instance attribute%
 }
 \HLAFixedBlock{89.999}{387.782}{432.001}{\rmfamily\raggedright}{9.96}{12.00}{%
 until the instance attribute becomes owned. From a given joined federate’s perspective, every instance%
 }
 \HLAFixedBlock{89.999}{399.781}{432.001}{\rmfamily\raggedright}{9.96}{12.00}{%
 attribute shall be either owned or unowned. Hence, within the state machine depicted in Figure 16, the%
 }
 \HLAFixedBlock{89.999}{411.781}{432.001}{\rmfamily\raggedright}{9.96}{12.00}{%
 owned and unowned states are exclusive.%
 }
 \HLAFixedBlock{89.999}{435.781}{432.001}{\rmfamily\raggedright}{9.96}{12.00}{%
 Upon registration of an object instance, the registering joined federate shall own all instance attributes of%
 }
 \HLAFixedBlock{89.999}{447.781}{432.001}{\rmfamily\raggedright}{9.96}{12.00}{%
 that object instance for which the joined federate is publishing the corresponding class attributes at the%
 }
 \HLAFixedBlock{89.999}{459.780}{432.001}{\rmfamily\raggedright}{9.96}{12.00}{%
 registered class of the object instance. All other instance attributes of that object instance shall be unowned%
 }
 \HLAFixedBlock{89.998}{471.780}{432.002}{\rmfamily\raggedright}{9.96}{12.00}{%
 by all joined federates. As a result of a new FOM Module merge, it is possible new instance attributes of an%
 }
 \HLAFixedBlock{89.998}{483.780}{432.002}{\rmfamily\raggedright}{9.96}{12.00}{%
 existing object are created. Those instance attributes shall be unowned by all joined federates. Upon%
 }
 \HLAFixedBlock{89.998}{495.780}{432.002}{\rmfamily\raggedright}{9.96}{12.00}{%
 discovery of an object instance, the discovering joined federate shall not own any instance attributes of that%
 }
 \HLAFixedBlock{89.998}{507.780}{432.002}{\rmfamily\raggedright}{9.96}{12.00}{%
 object instance. If a joined federate does not own an instance attribute, it shall not own that instance attribute%
 }
 \HLAFixedBlock{89.997}{519.779}{432.003}{\rmfamily\raggedright}{9.96}{12.00}{%
 until it has received an \emph{Attribute Ownership Acquisition Notification \textdagger{}} service invocation for it.%
 }
 \HLAFixedBlock{89.997}{543.779}{432.003}{\rmfamily\raggedright}{9.96}{12.00}{%
 Ownership of an instance attribute shall be transferred from one joined federate to another either by the%
 }
 \HLAFixedBlock{89.996}{555.779}{432.004}{\rmfamily\raggedright}{9.96}{12.00}{%
 owning joined federate requesting to divest itself of the instance attribute or by a non-owning joined federate%
 }
 \HLAFixedBlock{89.996}{567.779}{432.004}{\rmfamily\raggedright}{9.96}{12.00}{%
 requesting to acquire it. Regardless of whether an instance attribute changes ownership as a result of being%
 }
 \HLAFixedBlock{89.996}{579.779}{432.004}{\rmfamily\raggedright}{9.96}{12.00}{%
 divested by its owner or acquired by a non-owner, the instance attribute shall change ownership only as a%
 }
 \HLAFixedBlock{89.996}{591.778}{432.004}{\rmfamily\raggedright}{9.96}{12.00}{%
 result of explicit service invocations by the owning and acquiring joined federates. The RTI shall not take%
 }
 \HLAFixedBlock{89.996}{603.778}{432.004}{\rmfamily\raggedright}{9.96}{12.00}{%
 ownership away from, nor give it to, a joined federate without the joined federate’s consent, except through%
 }
 \HLAFixedBlock{89.996}{615.778}{432.004}{\rmfamily\raggedright}{9.96}{12.00}{%
 the use of the following MOM interactions:%
 }
 \HLAFixedBlock{100.016}{630.778}{421.984}{\rmfamily\raggedright}{9.96}{12.00}{%
 ---%
 }
 \HLAFixedBlock{121.976}{630.778}{400.024}{\rmfamily\raggedright}{9.96}{12.00}{%
 HLAmanager.HLAfederate.HLAadjust.HLAmodifyAttributeState%
 }
 \HLAFixedBlock{100.016}{645.777}{421.984}{\rmfamily\raggedright}{9.96}{12.00}{%
 ---%
 }
 \HLAFixedBlock{121.976}{645.777}{400.024}{\rmfamily\raggedright}{9.96}{12.00}{%
 HLAmanager.HLAfederate.HLAservice.HLAunpublishObjectClassAttributes%
 }
 \HLAFixedBlock{100.016}{660.777}{421.984}{\rmfamily\raggedright}{9.96}{12.00}{%
 ---%
 }
 \HLAFixedBlock{121.976}{660.777}{400.024}{\rmfamily\raggedright}{9.96}{12.00}{%
 HLAmanager.HLAfederate.HLAservice.HLAunconditionalAttributeOwnershipDivestiture%
 }
 \HLAFixedBlock{100.016}{675.777}{421.984}{\rmfamily\raggedright}{9.96}{12.00}{%
 ---%
 }
 \HLAFixedBlock{121.976}{675.777}{400.024}{\rmfamily\raggedright}{9.96}{12.00}{%
 HLAmanager.HLAfederate.HLAservice.HLAresignFederationExecution%
 }
\end{hlafixedpage}
