 }
 \HLAFixedBlock{90.001}{141.785}{431.999}{\rmfamily\raggedright}{9.96}{12.00}{%
 \emph{Divestiture Confirmation \textdagger{}} and \emph{Confirm Divestiture} services), the requesting joined federate successfully%
 }
 \HLAFixedBlock{90.001}{153.784}{431.999}{\rmfamily\raggedright}{9.96}{12.00}{%
 cancels the request (via the \emph{Cancel Negotiated Attribute Ownership Divestiture} service), or the joined%
 }
 \HLAFixedBlock{90.001}{165.784}{431.999}{\rmfamily\raggedright}{9.96}{12.00}{%
 federate divests itself of ownership by other means (e.g., the \emph{Attribute Ownership Divestiture If Wanted} or%
 }
 \HLAFixedBlock{90.001}{177.784}{431.999}{\rmfamily\raggedright}{9.96}{12.00}{%
 \emph{Unpublish Object Class Attributes} service). A second negotiated divestiture for an instance attribute already%
 }
 \HLAFixedBlock{90.001}{189.784}{431.999}{\rmfamily\raggedright}{9.96}{12.00}{%
 in the process of a negotiated divestiture shall result in an RTI-generated exception.%
 }
 \HLAFixedBlock{90.001}{213.783}{431.999}{\rmfamily\raggedright}{9.96}{12.00}{%
 If no joined federates are in either the Acquiring state or the Willing to Acquire state with respect to the%
