 instance attribute. If any joined federate is in either the Acquiring state or the Willing to Acquire state with%
 }
 \HLAFixedBlock{90.001}{249.783}{431.999}{\rmfamily\raggedright}{9.96}{12.00}{%
 respect to the specified instance attribute, the RTI may try to identify other joined federates that are willing%
 }
 \HLAFixedBlock{90.001}{261.783}{431.999}{\rmfamily\raggedright}{9.96}{12.00}{%
 to own the instance attribute. The mechanism that the RTI shall use to try to identify other joined federates%
 }
 \HLAFixedBlock{90.002}{273.783}{431.998}{\rmfamily\raggedright}{9.96}{12.00}{%
 that are willing to own the instance attribute is invocation of the \emph{Request Attribute Ownership Assumption \textdagger{}}%
 }
 \HLAFixedBlock{90.002}{285.782}{431.998}{\rmfamily\raggedright}{9.96}{12.00}{%
 service at joined federates that are both eligible to own the instance attribute and not in either the Acquiring%
 }
 \HLAFixedBlock{90.002}{297.782}{431.998}{\rmfamily\raggedright}{9.96}{12.00}{%
 state or the Willing to Acquire state with respect to the specified instance attribute.%
 }
