 \textbf{7.9 }\textbf{\emph{Attribute Ownership Acquisition If Available}}\textbf{ service}%
 }
 \HLAFixedBlock{90.000}{436.806}{432.000}{\rmfamily\raggedright}{9.96}{12.00}{%
 The \emph{Attribute Ownership Acquisition If Available} service shall request the ownership of the specified%
 }
 \HLAFixedBlock{90.000}{447.786}{432.000}{\rmfamily\raggedright}{9.96}{12.00}{%
 instance attributes of the specified object instance only if the instance attribute is unowned by all joined%
 }
 \HLAFixedBlock{90.000}{458.765}{432.000}{\rmfamily\raggedright}{9.96}{12.00}{%
 federates or it is in the process of being divested by its owner. If a specified instance attribute is owned by%
 }
 \HLAFixedBlock{90.000}{469.805}{432.000}{\rmfamily\raggedright}{9.96}{12.00}{%
 another joined federate, the RTI shall not invoke the \emph{Request Attribute Ownership Release \textdagger{}} service for that%
 }
 \HLAFixedBlock{90.001}{480.785}{431.999}{\rmfamily\raggedright}{9.96}{12.00}{%
 instance attribute at the owning joined federate. For each of the specified instance attributes, the joined%
 }
 \HLAFixedBlock{90.001}{491.825}{431.999}{\rmfamily\raggedright}{9.96}{12.00}{%
 federate may receive only a corresponding \emph{Attribute Ownership Acquisition Notification \textdagger{}} service%
 }
 \HLAFixedBlock{90.001}{502.805}{431.999}{\rmfamily\raggedright}{9.96}{12.00}{%
 invocation or a corresponding \emph{Attribute Ownership Unavailable \textdagger{}} service invocation.%
 }
 \HLAFixedBlock{90.001}{525.784}{431.999}{\rmfamily\raggedright}{9.96}{12.00}{%
 If a joined federate invokes the \emph{Attribute Ownership Acquisition If Available} service for an instance attribute%
 }
 \HLAFixedBlock{90.000}{536.824}{432.000}{\rmfamily\raggedright}{9.96}{12.00}{%
 that is already in the Willing to Acquire state, that instance attribute’s state shall remain unchanged.%
 }
 \HLAFixedBlock{90.000}{559.804}{432.000}{\rmfamily\raggedright}{9.96}{12.00}{%
 In other words, if a joined federate invokes the \emph{Attribute Ownership Acquisition If Available} service for an%
 }
 \HLAFixedBlock{90.000}{570.783}{432.000}{\rmfamily\raggedright}{9.96}{12.00}{%
 instance attribute for which the joined federate is in the Willing to Acquire state, that instance attribute shall%
 }
 \HLAFixedBlock{89.999}{581.823}{432.001}{\rmfamily\raggedright}{9.96}{12.00}{%
 continue to be in the Willing to Acquire state. If there are additional instance attributes in the attribute set%
 }
 \HLAFixedBlock{89.999}{592.803}{432.001}{\rmfamily\raggedright}{9.96}{12.00}{%
 that is an argument to the \emph{Attribute Ownership Acquisition If Available} service, the joined federate shall%
 }
 \HLAFixedBlock{90.000}{603.783}{432.000}{\rmfamily\raggedright}{9.96}{12.00}{%
 enter the Willing to Acquire state with respect to those instance attributes, assuming that they meet all of the%
 }
 \HLAFixedBlock{90.001}{614.823}{431.999}{\rmfamily\raggedright}{9.96}{12.00}{%
 preconditions of the \emph{Attribute Ownership Acquisition If Available} service and that the joined federate is not%
 }
 \HLAFixedBlock{90.001}{625.802}{431.999}{\rmfamily\raggedright}{9.96}{12.00}{%
 already in the Willing to Acquire state.%
 }
