 \HLAFixedBlock{90.000}{148.806}{432.000}{\rmfamily\raggedright}{9.96}{12.00}{%
 The \emph{Next Message Request} service shall request the logical time of the joined federate to be advanced to the%
 }
 \HLAFixedBlock{90.000}{160.805}{432.000}{\rmfamily\raggedright}{9.96}{12.00}{%
 timestamp of the next TSO message that will be delivered to the joined federate, provided that message has%
 }
 \HLAFixedBlock{90.000}{172.805}{432.000}{\rmfamily\raggedright}{9.96}{12.00}{%
 a timestamp no greater than the logical time specified in the request. %
 }
 \HLAFixedBlock{90.000}{196.805}{432.000}{\rmfamily\raggedright}{9.96}{12.00}{%
 Invocation of this service shall cause the following set of messages to be delivered to the joined federate: %
 }
 \HLAFixedBlock{100.020}{211.805}{421.980}{\rmfamily\raggedright}{9.96}{12.00}{%
 ---%
 }
 \HLAFixedBlock{121.980}{211.805}{400.020}{\rmfamily\raggedright}{9.96}{12.00}{%
 All messages queued in the RTI that the joined federate will receive as RO messages%
 }
 \HLAFixedBlock{100.020}{226.804}{421.980}{\rmfamily\raggedright}{9.96}{12.00}{%
 ---%
 }
 \HLAFixedBlock{121.980}{226.804}{400.020}{\rmfamily\raggedright}{9.96}{12.00}{%
 The smallest timestamped message that will ever be received by the joined federate as a TSO%
 }
 \HLAFixedBlock{121.980}{238.804}{400.020}{\rmfamily\raggedright}{9.96}{12.00}{%
 message with a timestamp less than or equal to the specified logical time, and all other messages%
 }
 \HLAFixedBlock{121.980}{250.804}{400.020}{\rmfamily\raggedright}{9.96}{12.00}{%
 containing the same timestamp that the joined federate will receive as TSO messages%
 }
 \HLAFixedBlock{89.999}{274.804}{432.001}{\rmfamily\raggedright}{9.96}{12.00}{%
 After invocation of the \emph{Next Message Request} service, the messages shall be passed to the joined federate%
 }
 \HLAFixedBlock{89.999}{286.803}{432.001}{\rmfamily\raggedright}{9.96}{12.00}{%
 when the RTI invokes the \emph{Receive Interaction \textdagger{},} \emph{Reflect Attribute Values \textdagger{},} and \emph{Remove Object Instance \textdagger{}}%
 }
 \HLAFixedBlock{89.999}{298.803}{432.001}{\rmfamily\raggedright}{9.96}{12.00}{%
 services. %
 }
 \HLAFixedBlock{89.999}{322.803}{432.001}{\rmfamily\raggedright}{9.96}{12.00}{%
 By invoking \emph{Next Message Request} with the specified logical time, the joined federate is guaranteeing that it%
 }
 \HLAFixedBlock{89.999}{334.803}{432.001}{\rmfamily\raggedright}{9.96}{12.00}{%
 will not generate a TSO message before the next \emph{Time Advance Grant \textdagger{}} service invocation with a timestamp%
 }
 \HLAFixedBlock{89.999}{346.803}{432.001}{\rmfamily\raggedright}{9.96}{12.00}{%
 less than or equal to the specified logical time (or less than the specified logical time plus the actual%
 }
 \HLAFixedBlock{89.999}{358.802}{432.001}{\rmfamily\raggedright}{9.96}{12.00}{%
 lookahead the joined federate would have if it were granted to the specified logical time if its lookahead is%
 }
 \HLAFixedBlock{89.999}{370.802}{432.001}{\rmfamily\raggedright}{9.96}{12.00}{%
 not zero).%
 }
 \HLAFixedBlock{89.999}{394.802}{432.001}{\rmfamily\raggedright}{9.96}{12.00}{%
 If it does not receive any TSO messages before the \emph{Time Advance Grant \textdagger{}} service invocation, the joined%
 }
 \HLAFixedBlock{89.999}{406.802}{432.001}{\rmfamily\raggedright}{9.96}{12.00}{%
 federate shall guarantee that it will not generate a TSO message at any point in the future with a timestamp%
 }
 \HLAFixedBlock{89.999}{418.801}{432.001}{\rmfamily\raggedright}{9.96}{12.00}{%
 less than or equal to the specified logical time (or less than the specified logical time plus its actual%
 }
 \HLAFixedBlock{89.999}{430.801}{432.001}{\rmfamily\raggedright}{9.96}{12.00}{%
 lookahead if its lookahead is not zero).%
 }
 \HLAFixedBlock{89.999}{454.801}{432.001}{\rmfamily\raggedright}{9.96}{12.00}{%
 If it does receive any TSO messages before the \emph{Time Advance Grant \textdagger{}} service invocation, the joined%
 }
 \HLAFixedBlock{89.999}{466.801}{432.001}{\rmfamily\raggedright}{9.96}{12.00}{%
 federate shall guarantee that it will not generate a TSO message at any point in the future with a timestamp%
 }
 \HLAFixedBlock{89.999}{478.800}{432.001}{\rmfamily\raggedright}{9.96}{12.00}{%
 less than or equal to the logical time of the grant (or less than the logical time of the grant plus its actual%
 }
 \HLAFixedBlock{89.999}{490.800}{432.001}{\rmfamily\raggedright}{9.96}{12.00}{%
 lookahead if its lookahead is not zero).%
 }
 \HLAFixedBlock{89.999}{514.800}{432.001}{\rmfamily\raggedright}{9.96}{12.00}{%
 A \emph{Time Advance Grant \textdagger{}} service invocation shall complete this request and indicate to the joined federate%
 }
 \HLAFixedBlock{89.998}{526.800}{432.002}{\rmfamily\raggedright}{9.96}{12.00}{%
 that it has advanced its logical time to the timestamp of the TSO messages that are delivered, if any, or to the%
 }
 \HLAFixedBlock{89.998}{538.799}{432.002}{\rmfamily\raggedright}{9.96}{12.00}{%
 specified logical time if no TSO messages were delivered. It shall also indicate that no TSO messages will%
 }
 \HLAFixedBlock{89.998}{550.799}{432.002}{\rmfamily\raggedright}{9.96}{12.00}{%
 be delivered to the joined federate in the future with timestamps less than or equal to the logical time of the%
 }
 \HLAFixedBlock{89.998}{562.799}{432.002}{\rmfamily\raggedright}{9.96}{12.00}{%
 grant. For time-constrained joined federates, requests for which either LITS or the specified logical time is%
 }
 \HLAFixedBlock{89.998}{574.799}{432.002}{\rmfamily\raggedright}{9.96}{12.00}{%
 less than GALT can be granted without waiting for other joined federates to advance.%
 }
