 \HLAFixedBlock{90.000}{69.786}{432.000}{\rmfamily\raggedright}{9.96}{12.00}{%
 After invoking the \emph{Flush Queue Request} service, the messages shall be passed to the joined federate when%
 }
 \HLAFixedBlock{90.000}{81.785}{432.000}{\rmfamily\raggedright}{9.96}{12.00}{%
 the RTI invokes the \emph{Receive Interaction \textdagger{},} \emph{Reflect Attribute Values \textdagger{},} and \emph{Remove Object Instance \textdagger{}}%
 }
 \HLAFixedBlock{89.998}{93.785}{432.002}{\rmfamily\raggedright}{9.96}{12.00}{%
 services. %
 }
 \HLAFixedBlock{89.998}{117.785}{432.002}{\rmfamily\raggedright}{9.96}{12.00}{%
 By invoking the \emph{Flush Queue Request} service with the specified logical time, the joined federate is%
 }
 \HLAFixedBlock{89.998}{129.785}{432.002}{\rmfamily\raggedright}{9.96}{12.00}{%
 guaranteeing that it will not generate a TSO message before the next \emph{Flush Queue Grant \textdagger{}} service%
 }
 \HLAFixedBlock{89.997}{141.785}{432.003}{\rmfamily\raggedright}{9.96}{12.00}{%
 invocation with a timestamp less than the specified logical time plus the actual lookahead the joined federate%
 }
 \HLAFixedBlock{89.997}{153.784}{432.003}{\rmfamily\raggedright}{9.96}{12.00}{%
 would have if it were granted to the specified logical time.%
 }
 \HLAFixedBlock{89.997}{177.784}{432.003}{\rmfamily\raggedright}{9.96}{12.00}{%
 After the \emph{Flush Queue Grant \textdagger{}} service invocation, the joined federate shall guarantee that it shall not%
 }
 \HLAFixedBlock{89.998}{189.784}{432.002}{\rmfamily\raggedright}{9.96}{12.00}{%
 generate a TSO message with a timestamp less than the optimistic logical time of the grant plus the%
 }
 \HLAFixedBlock{89.998}{201.784}{432.002}{\rmfamily\raggedright}{9.96}{12.00}{%
 lookahead it would have if granted to this time. Subsequent invocations of Flush Queue Request may reduce%
 }
 \HLAFixedBlock{89.998}{213.783}{432.002}{\rmfamily\raggedright}{9.96}{12.00}{%
 the optimistic logical time. It shall never be reduced below the logical time value.%
 }
 \HLAFixedBlock{89.998}{237.783}{432.002}{\rmfamily\raggedright}{9.96}{12.00}{%
 A \emph{Flush Queue Grant \textdagger{}} service invocation shall complete this request and indicate to the joined federate that%
 }
 \HLAFixedBlock{89.998}{249.783}{432.002}{\rmfamily\raggedright}{9.96}{12.00}{%
 it has advanced to the logical time of the grant and no additional TSO messages shall be delivered to the%
 }
 \HLAFixedBlock{89.998}{261.783}{432.002}{\rmfamily\raggedright}{9.96}{12.00}{%
 joined federate in the future with timestamps less than the logical time of the grant. A \emph{Flush Queue Request}%
 }
 \HLAFixedBlock{89.997}{273.783}{432.003}{\rmfamily\raggedright}{9.96}{12.00}{%
 service can always be granted without waiting for other joined federates to advance. However, all time%
 }
 \HLAFixedBlock{89.997}{285.782}{432.003}{\rmfamily\raggedright}{9.96}{12.00}{%
 advances shall account for in transit messages.%
 }
 \HLAFixedBlock{89.997}{309.782}{432.003}{\rmfamily\raggedright}{9.96}{12.00}{%
 Since the \emph{Flush Queue Request} service results in the delivery of all queued TSO messages, not just those the%
 }
 \HLAFixedBlock{89.997}{321.782}{432.003}{\rmfamily\raggedright}{9.96}{12.00}{%
 RTI can guarantee are safe to deliver, there are two consequences the receiving joined federate shall be%
 }
 \HLAFixedBlock{89.997}{333.782}{432.003}{\rmfamily\raggedright}{9.96}{12.00}{%
 prepared to handle. First, messages may later be received that have timestamps that are smaller than those of%
 }
 \HLAFixedBlock{89.997}{345.781}{432.003}{\rmfamily\raggedright}{9.96}{12.00}{%
 some messages received in response to the \emph{Flush Queue Request} service invocation, and this sequencing%
 }
 \HLAFixedBlock{89.997}{357.781}{432.003}{\rmfamily\raggedright}{9.96}{12.00}{%
 violates timestamped ordering. Second, some messages delivered may still be eligible for retraction by their%
 }
 \HLAFixedBlock{89.997}{369.781}{432.003}{\rmfamily\raggedright}{9.96}{12.00}{%
 originators; therefore, the receiving joined federate shall be capable of dealing with \emph{Request Retraction \textdagger{}}%
 }
 \HLAFixedBlock{89.997}{381.781}{432.003}{\rmfamily\raggedright}{9.96}{12.00}{%
 service invocations for these messages.%
 }
