 \HLAFixedBlock{90.000}{292.806}{432.000}{\rmfamily\raggedright}{9.96}{12.00}{%
 The \emph{Modify Lookahead} service shall request a change to the joined federate’s lookahead. A joined federate%
 }
 \HLAFixedBlock{90.001}{304.805}{431.999}{\rmfamily\raggedright}{9.96}{12.00}{%
 may not request a change to its lookahead while it is in the Time Advancing state. The specified lookahead%
 }
 \HLAFixedBlock{90.001}{316.805}{431.999}{\rmfamily\raggedright}{9.96}{12.00}{%
 shall be greater than or equal to zero. If the requested value is greater than or equal to the joined federate’s%
 }
 \HLAFixedBlock{90.000}{328.805}{432.000}{\rmfamily\raggedright}{9.96}{12.00}{%
 actual lookahead, the change shall take effect immediately, and the requested lookahead shall become the%
 }
 \HLAFixedBlock{90.000}{340.805}{432.000}{\rmfamily\raggedright}{9.96}{12.00}{%
 actual lookahead. If the requested value is less than the joined federate’s actual lookahead, the change shall%
 }
 \HLAFixedBlock{90.000}{352.805}{432.000}{\rmfamily\raggedright}{9.96}{12.00}{%
 take effect gradually as the joined federate advances its logical time, and the actual lookahead is initially%
 }
 \HLAFixedBlock{90.000}{364.805}{432.000}{\rmfamily\raggedright}{9.96}{12.00}{%
 unchanged. Specifically, the joined federate’s actual lookahead shall decrease by \emph{T} units whenever logical%
 }
 \HLAFixedBlock{89.999}{376.804}{432.001}{\rmfamily\raggedright}{9.96}{12.00}{%
 time advances \emph{T} units until the requested lookahead is reached.%
 }
