 \HLAServiceHeadingAt{324.383}{%
 \textbf{8.23 }\textbf{\emph{Request Retraction \textdagger{}}}\textbf{ service}%
 }
 \HLAFixedBlock{90.000}{349.806}{432.000}{\rmfamily\raggedright}{9.96}{12.00}{%
 If the RTI receives a legal \emph{Retract} service invocation for a message that has already been delivered to a%
 }
 \HLAFixedBlock{89.999}{361.805}{432.001}{\rmfamily\raggedright}{9.96}{12.00}{%
 joined federate, the \emph{Request Retraction \textdagger{}} service shall be invoked on that joined federate. If the message in%
 }
 \HLAFixedBlock{89.999}{373.805}{432.001}{\rmfamily\raggedright}{9.96}{12.00}{%
 question is queued in the RTI and has not been delivered to the joined federate, the message shall be%
 }
 \HLAFixedBlock{89.999}{385.805}{432.001}{\rmfamily\raggedright}{9.96}{12.00}{%
 dequeued from the RTI and will never be delivered to the joined federate.%
 }
 \HLAFixedBlock{89.999}{409.805}{432.001}{\rmfamily\raggedright}{9.96}{12.00}{%
 Time-constrained joined federates that do not use the \emph{Flush Queue Request} service are not subject to%
 }
 \HLAFixedBlock{89.999}{421.805}{432.001}{\rmfamily\raggedright}{9.96}{12.00}{%
 invocation of the \emph{Request Retraction \textdagger{} }service on any received TSO message because they will never%
 }
 \HLAFixedBlock{89.999}{433.804}{432.001}{\rmfamily\raggedright}{9.96}{12.00}{%
 receive TSO messages that are eligible for retraction. Nonconstrained joined federates, however, shall be%
 }
 \HLAFixedBlock{89.998}{445.804}{432.002}{\rmfamily\raggedright}{9.96}{12.00}{%
 prepared to deal with invocations of this service because any message received that was sent as a TSO%
 }
 \HLAFixedBlock{89.998}{457.804}{432.002}{\rmfamily\raggedright}{9.96}{12.00}{%
 message may be eligible for retraction.%
 }
 \HLAFixedBlock{89.998}{481.804}{432.002}{\rmfamily\raggedright}{9.96}{12.00}{%
 Since the joined federate is required to save the message retraction designator in order to perform a%
 }
 \HLAFixedBlock{89.998}{493.803}{432.002}{\rmfamily\raggedright}{9.96}{12.00}{%
 retraction, the RTI is not required to ensure the message was actually delivered to the federate. The RTI is%
 }
 \HLAFixedBlock{89.998}{505.803}{432.002}{\rmfamily\raggedright}{9.96}{12.00}{%
 only required to ensure that a message is not delivered to a joined federate after a retraction for that message%
 }
 \HLAFixedBlock{89.998}{517.803}{432.002}{\rmfamily\raggedright}{9.96}{12.00}{%
 has been requested.%
 }
