 \HLAServiceComponentHeadingAt{353.206}{%
 \textbf{9.1.5 Reinterpretation of selected DM services}%
 }
 \HLAFixedBlock{90.000}{377.345}{432.000}{\rmfamily\raggedright}{9.96}{12.00}{%
 Some DDM services can be used to perform similar functions to what is accomplished with DM services.%
 }
 \HLAFixedBlock{90.000}{389.345}{432.000}{\rmfamily\raggedright}{9.96}{12.00}{%
 When a joined federate uses DDM services, some of the DM definitions, constraints and services described%
 }
 \HLAFixedBlock{90.000}{401.345}{432.000}{\rmfamily\raggedright}{9.96}{12.00}{%
 in Clause 6 shall be extended to encompass the expanded interpretation of how DM services work when%
 }
 \HLAFixedBlock{90.000}{413.345}{432.000}{\rmfamily\raggedright}{9.96}{12.00}{%
 used in conjunction with DDM services by a joined federate, from the perspective of that joined federate.%
 }
 \HLAFixedBlock{90.000}{437.344}{432.000}{\rmfamily\raggedright}{9.96}{12.00}{%
 A joined federate that is using DDM services shall interpret all uses of the following four DM services by%
 }
 \HLAFixedBlock{90.000}{449.344}{432.000}{\rmfamily\raggedright}{9.96}{12.00}{%
 any joined federate (including itself) in the federation execution:%
 }
 \HLAFixedBlock{100.020}{467.344}{421.980}{\rmfamily\raggedright}{9.96}{12.00}{%
 ---%
 }
 \HLAFixedBlock{121.980}{467.344}{400.020}{\rmfamily\raggedright}{9.96}{12.00}{%
 \emph{Subscribe Object Class Attributes}%
 }
 \HLAFixedBlock{100.020}{482.344}{421.980}{\rmfamily\raggedright}{9.96}{12.00}{%
 ---%
 }
 \HLAFixedBlock{121.980}{482.344}{400.020}{\rmfamily\raggedright}{9.96}{12.00}{%
 \emph{Unsubscribe Object Class Attributes}%
 }
 \HLAFixedBlock{100.020}{497.343}{421.980}{\rmfamily\raggedright}{9.96}{12.00}{%
 ---%
 }
 \HLAFixedBlock{121.980}{497.343}{400.020}{\rmfamily\raggedright}{9.96}{12.00}{%
 \emph{Subscribe Interaction Class}%
 }
 \HLAFixedBlock{100.020}{512.343}{421.980}{\rmfamily\raggedright}{9.96}{12.00}{%
 ---%
 }
 \HLAFixedBlock{121.980}{512.343}{400.020}{\rmfamily\raggedright}{9.96}{12.00}{%
 \emph{Unsubscribe Interaction Class}%
 }
 \HLAFixedBlock{89.999}{536.343}{432.001}{\rmfamily\raggedright}{9.96}{12.00}{%
 as special cases of the following DDM services, respectively:%
 }
 \HLAFixedBlock{100.019}{551.342}{421.981}{\rmfamily\raggedright}{9.96}{12.00}{%
 \emph{---}%
 }
 \HLAFixedBlock{121.978}{551.342}{400.022}{\rmfamily\raggedright}{9.96}{12.00}{%
 \emph{Subscribe Object Class Attributes With Regions}%
 }
 \HLAFixedBlock{100.019}{566.342}{421.981}{\rmfamily\raggedright}{9.96}{12.00}{%
 \emph{---}%
 }
 \HLAFixedBlock{121.978}{566.342}{400.022}{\rmfamily\raggedright}{9.96}{12.00}{%
 \emph{Unsubscribe Object Class Attributes With Regions}%
 }
 \HLAFixedBlock{100.019}{581.342}{421.981}{\rmfamily\raggedright}{9.96}{12.00}{%
 \emph{---}%
 }
 \HLAFixedBlock{121.978}{581.342}{400.022}{\rmfamily\raggedright}{9.96}{12.00}{%
 \emph{Subscribe Interaction Class With Regions}%
 }
 \HLAFixedBlock{100.019}{596.342}{421.981}{\rmfamily\raggedright}{9.96}{12.00}{%
 \emph{---}%
 }
 \HLAFixedBlock{121.978}{596.342}{400.022}{\rmfamily\raggedright}{9.96}{12.00}{%
 \emph{Unsubscribe Interaction Class With Regions}%
 }
 \HLAFixedBlock{89.999}{620.341}{432.001}{\rmfamily\raggedright}{9.96}{12.00}{%
 From the perspective of the joined federate that is using DDM services, each of the four DM services listed%
 }
 \HLAFixedBlock{89.999}{632.341}{432.001}{\rmfamily\raggedright}{9.96}{12.00}{%
 above shall be defined to be equivalent to the corresponding DDM service when invoked with a region%
 }
 \HLAFixedBlock{89.999}{644.341}{432.001}{\rmfamily\raggedright}{9.96}{12.00}{%
 argument of the default region.%
 }
 \HLAFixedBlock{89.999}{668.341}{432.001}{\rmfamily\raggedright}{9.96}{12.00}{%
 In practice, because there shall be no way to refer to the default region, there shall be no way to substitute a%
 }
 \HLAFixedBlock{89.999}{680.340}{432.001}{\rmfamily\raggedright}{9.96}{12.00}{%
 DDM service for its corresponding DM service. Furthermore, a given joined federate may invoke both the%
 }
 \HLAFixedBlock{89.999}{692.340}{432.001}{\rmfamily\raggedright}{9.96}{12.00}{%
 DM services listed above and their corresponding DDM services using the same object class and class%
 }
 \HLAFixedBlock{89.999}{704.340}{432.001}{\rmfamily\raggedright}{9.96}{12.00}{%
 attribute designators or interaction class designators as arguments and there shall be no interaction between%
 }
\end{hlafixedpage}
