 }
 \HLAFixedBlock{90.000}{153.784}{432.000}{\rmfamily\raggedright}{9.96}{12.00}{%
 Set of Sent Region Designators argument with invocations of \emph{Reflect Attribute Values \textdagger{}} and \emph{Receive}%
 }
 \HLAFixedBlock{90.001}{165.784}{431.999}{\rmfamily\raggedright}{9.96}{12.00}{%
 \emph{Interaction \textdagger{} }services at the joined federate.%
 }
 \HLAFixedBlock{90.001}{189.784}{431.999}{\rmfamily\raggedright}{9.96}{12.00}{%
 The federation-wide initial setting for this switch shall come from the FDD supplied to the \emph{Create}%
 }
 \HLAFixedBlock{90.001}{201.784}{431.999}{\rmfamily\raggedright}{9.96}{12.00}{%
 \emph{Federation Execution} service invocation for the federation execution. If no value is specified for this switch,%
 }
 \HLAFixedBlock{90.001}{213.783}{431.999}{\rmfamily\raggedright}{9.96}{12.00}{%
 then the RTI will provide default values based on the switches table defaults table in IEEE Std 1516.2-2025.%
 }
 \HLAFixedBlock{90.001}{225.783}{431.999}{\rmfamily\raggedright}{9.96}{12.00}{%
 This switch setting shall be modifiable during a federation execution via the \emph{Set Convey Region Designator}%
 }
 \HLAFixedBlock{90.001}{237.783}{431.999}{\rmfamily\raggedright}{9.96}{12.00}{%
 \emph{Sets} support service or the HLAmanager.HLAfederation.HLAadjust.HLAsetSwitches MOM interaction. %
 }
 \HLAFixedBlock{90.002}{261.783}{431.998}{\rmfamily\raggedright}{9.96}{12.00}{%
 Whenever this switch is enabled at a joined federate, the optional Set of Sent Region Designators argument%
 }
 \HLAFixedBlock{90.002}{273.783}{431.998}{\rmfamily\raggedright}{9.96}{12.00}{%
 shall be provided (as appropriate) with all \emph{Reflect Attribute Values \textdagger{}} and \emph{Receive Interaction \textdagger{}} service%
 }
 \HLAFixedBlock{90.002}{285.782}{431.998}{\rmfamily\raggedright}{9.96}{12.00}{%
 invocations at that joined federates. For the \emph{Reflect Attribute Values \textdagger{}} service, if the specified instance%
 }
 \HLAFixedBlock{90.002}{297.782}{431.998}{\rmfamily\raggedright}{9.96}{12.00}{%
 attributes have available dimensions, the Set of Sent Region Designators argument shall contain the%
 }
 \HLAFixedBlock{90.002}{309.782}{431.998}{\rmfamily\raggedright}{9.96}{12.00}{%
 respective update region set. For the \emph{Receive Interaction \textdagger{}} service, if the specified interaction has available%
 }
 \HLAFixedBlock{90.002}{321.782}{431.998}{\rmfamily\raggedright}{9.96}{12.00}{%
 dimensions, the Set of Sent Region Designators argument shall contain the respective update region set.%
 }
 \HLAFixedBlock{90.002}{345.781}{431.998}{\rmfamily\raggedright}{9.96}{12.00}{%
 If the specified interaction or corresponding class attributes has available dimensions, this switch is enabled,%
 }
 \HLAFixedBlock{90.001}{357.781}{431.999}{\rmfamily\raggedright}{9.96}{12.00}{%
 and no region designator set is supplied, then the default region shall have been used on the sending side. In%
 }
 \HLAFixedBlock{90.001}{369.781}{431.999}{\rmfamily\raggedright}{9.96}{12.00}{%
 this case, the Convey Region set argument shall be present and empty.%
 }
 \HLAFixedBlock{90.001}{393.781}{431.999}{\rmfamily\raggedright}{9.96}{12.00}{%
 A joined federate shall use the region realization designators received in conveyed region sets only in the%
 }
 \HLAFixedBlock{90.000}{405.780}{432.000}{\rmfamily\raggedright}{9.96}{12.00}{%
 \emph{Get Range Bounds} and \emph{Get Dimension Handle Set} service invocations.%
 }
 \HLAFixedBlock{90.000}{429.780}{432.000}{\rmfamily\raggedright}{9.96}{12.00}{%
 The Set of Sent Region Designators conveyed is not a set of designators of region specifications or a set of%
