 \HLAFixedBlock{89.996}{681.776}{432.004}{\rmfamily\raggedright}{9.96}{12.00}{%
 If this setting is disabled, DDM region overlaps shall be determined strictly through the specified%
 }
 \HLAFixedBlock{89.996}{693.776}{432.004}{\rmfamily\raggedright}{9.96}{12.00}{%
 comparison of range bound values without relaxation by the RTI implementation (see 9.1.4). If the setting is%
 }
 \HLAFixedBlock{89.996}{705.776}{432.004}{\rmfamily\raggedright}{9.96}{12.00}{%
 enabled, the RTI may introduce implementation specific criteria that relaxes the overlap criteria allowing%
 }
