 \HLAServiceHeadingAt{159.383}{%
 \textbf{9.8 }\textbf{\emph{Subscribe Object Class Attributes With Regions}}\textbf{ service}%
 }
 \HLAFixedBlock{90.000}{184.806}{432.000}{\rmfamily\raggedright}{9.96}{12.00}{%
 The \emph{Subscribe Object Class Attributes With Regions} service shall specify an object class for which the RTI%
 }
 \HLAFixedBlock{90.000}{196.805}{432.000}{\rmfamily\raggedright}{9.96}{12.00}{%
 shall begin notifying the joined federate of discovery of instantiated object instances when at least one of%
 }
 \HLAFixedBlock{90.000}{208.805}{432.000}{\rmfamily\raggedright}{9.96}{12.00}{%
 that object instance’s instance attributes is in scope. This service and subsequent related RTI operations shall%
 }
 \HLAFixedBlock{90.000}{220.805}{432.000}{\rmfamily\raggedright}{9.96}{12.00}{%
 behave analogously to the \emph{Subscribe Object Class Attributes} service as described in 5.8 and its subsequent%
 }
 \HLAFixedBlock{89.999}{232.805}{432.001}{\rmfamily\raggedright}{9.96}{12.00}{%
 related RTI operations. This service shall provide additional functionality in that the overlap of the relevant%
 }
 \HLAFixedBlock{89.999}{244.805}{432.001}{\rmfamily\raggedright}{9.96}{12.00}{%
 subscription and update region sets affects the subsequent RTI operations, as described in 9.1.5.%
 }
 \HLAFixedBlock{89.999}{268.804}{432.001}{\rmfamily\raggedright}{9.96}{12.00}{%
 This service shall add the specified regions to the set of subscriptions of the specified class attributes. No%
 }
 \HLAFixedBlock{89.999}{280.804}{432.001}{\rmfamily\raggedright}{9.96}{12.00}{%
 changes shall be made to the subscription set if the specified regions are already in the set of subscriptions of%
 }
 \HLAFixedBlock{89.999}{292.804}{432.001}{\rmfamily\raggedright}{9.96}{12.00}{%
 the specified class attributes.%
 }
 \HLAFixedBlock{89.999}{316.804}{432.001}{\rmfamily\raggedright}{9.96}{12.00}{%
 Invocations of the \emph{Subscribe Object Class Attributes With Regions }service shall have no affect on any object%
 }
 \HLAFixedBlock{90.000}{328.803}{432.000}{\rmfamily\raggedright}{9.96}{12.00}{%
 class or class attribute subscriptions that were established via the \emph{Subscribe Object Class Attributes} service.%
 }
 \HLAFixedBlock{90.000}{340.803}{432.000}{\rmfamily\raggedright}{9.96}{12.00}{%
 Subscriptions that are established via the \emph{Subscribe Object Class Attributes With Regions }service shall not%
 }
 \HLAFixedBlock{89.999}{352.803}{432.001}{\rmfamily\raggedright}{9.96}{12.00}{%
 be affected by invocations of either the \emph{Subscribe Object Class} \emph{Attributes} service or the \emph{Unsubscribe Object}%
 }
 \HLAFixedBlock{89.999}{364.803}{432.001}{\rmfamily\raggedright}{9.96}{12.00}{%
 \emph{Class Attributes} service.%
 }
 \HLAFixedBlock{89.999}{388.802}{432.001}{\rmfamily\raggedright}{9.96}{12.00}{%
 If the region set paired with a class attribute is empty, no subscriptions shall be added for that class attribute,%
 }
 \HLAFixedBlock{89.998}{400.802}{432.002}{\rmfamily\raggedright}{9.96}{12.00}{%
 not even the default region. Use of an empty set is not equivalent to invocation of the \emph{Subscribe Object Class}%
 }
 \HLAFixedBlock{89.998}{412.802}{432.002}{\rmfamily\raggedright}{9.96}{12.00}{%
 \emph{Attributes} service.%
 }
 \HLAFixedBlock{89.998}{436.802}{432.002}{\rmfamily\raggedright}{9.96}{12.00}{%
 If the optional passive subscription indicator indicates that this is a passive subscription, then the following%
 }
 \HLAFixedBlock{89.998}{448.802}{432.002}{\rmfamily\raggedright}{9.96}{12.00}{%
 apply:%
 }
 \HLAFixedBlock{100.018}{460.801}{421.982}{\rmfamily\raggedright}{9.96}{12.00}{%
 a)%
 }
 \HLAFixedBlock{121.974}{460.801}{400.026}{\rmfamily\raggedright}{9.96}{12.00}{%
 The invocation of this service shall not cause the \emph{Start Registration For Object Class \textdagger{}} service or the%
 }
 \HLAFixedBlock{121.978}{472.801}{400.022}{\rmfamily\raggedright}{9.96}{12.00}{%
 \emph{Turn Updates On For Object Instance \textdagger{}} service to be invoked at any other joined federate, and%
 }
 \HLAFixedBlock{100.018}{484.801}{421.982}{\rmfamily\raggedright}{9.96}{12.00}{%
 b)%
 }
 \HLAFixedBlock{121.978}{484.801}{400.022}{\rmfamily\raggedright}{9.96}{12.00}{%
 If a specified region was used in a previous subscription that was active rather than passive, this%
 }
 \HLAFixedBlock{121.978}{496.801}{400.022}{\rmfamily\raggedright}{9.96}{12.00}{%
 invocation shall change the previous subscription to passive. Invocation of this service may cause%
 }
