 \textbf{9.12 }\textbf{\emph{Send Interaction With Regions}}\textbf{ service}%
 }
 \HLAFixedBlock{90.000}{496.806}{432.000}{\rmfamily\raggedright}{9.96}{12.00}{%
 The \emph{Send Interaction With Regions} service shall send an interaction into the federation. Only parameters that%
 }
 \HLAFixedBlock{90.000}{508.805}{432.000}{\rmfamily\raggedright}{9.96}{12.00}{%
 are available at the specified interaction class may be sent in a given interaction, but a federate is not%
 }
 \HLAFixedBlock{90.000}{520.805}{432.000}{\rmfamily\raggedright}{9.96}{12.00}{%
 required to send all available parameters of the interaction class with the interaction. The regions shall be%
 }
 \HLAFixedBlock{90.000}{532.805}{432.000}{\rmfamily\raggedright}{9.96}{12.00}{%
 used to limit the scope of potential receivers of the interaction.%
 }
 \HLAFixedBlock{90.000}{556.805}{432.000}{\rmfamily\raggedright}{9.96}{12.00}{%
 If preferred order type (see 8.1.3) of the interaction is TSO, the joined federate invoking this service is%
 }
 \HLAFixedBlock{90.000}{568.804}{432.000}{\rmfamily\raggedright}{9.96}{12.00}{%
 time-regulating, and the timestamp argument is present, this service shall return a federation-unique%
 }
 \HLAFixedBlock{90.000}{580.804}{432.000}{\rmfamily\raggedright}{9.96}{12.00}{%
 message retraction designator. Otherwise, no message retraction designator shall be returned. A timestamp%
 }
 \HLAFixedBlock{90.000}{592.804}{432.000}{\rmfamily\raggedright}{9.96}{12.00}{%
 value should be provided if the preferred order type of the interaction is TSO and the joined federate%
 }
 \HLAFixedBlock{90.000}{604.804}{432.000}{\rmfamily\raggedright}{9.96}{12.00}{%
 invoking this service is time-regulating.%
 }
 \HLAFixedBlock{90.000}{628.803}{432.000}{\rmfamily\raggedright}{9.96}{12.00}{%
 Following the invocation of this service, if, at any wall-clock time when the RTI has not yet invoked a%
 }
 \HLAFixedBlock{90.000}{640.803}{432.000}{\rmfamily\raggedright}{9.96}{12.00}{%
 corresponding \emph{Receive Interaction \textdagger{}} service at a potentially receiving joined federate, that joined federate is%
 }
 \HLAFixedBlock{90.000}{652.803}{432.000}{\rmfamily\raggedright}{9.96}{12.00}{%
 either%
 }
 \HLAFixedBlock{100.020}{664.803}{421.980}{\rmfamily\raggedright}{9.96}{12.00}{%
 a)%
 }
 \HLAFixedBlock{121.979}{664.803}{400.021}{\rmfamily\raggedright}{9.96}{12.00}{%
 Unsubscribed to the specified interaction class, or%
 }
 \HLAFixedBlock{100.020}{676.803}{421.980}{\rmfamily\raggedright}{9.96}{12.00}{%
 b)%
 }
 \HLAFixedBlock{121.980}{676.803}{400.020}{\rmfamily\raggedright}{9.96}{12.00}{%
 Using a subscription region set for the specified interaction class and this region set does not overlap%
 }
 \HLAFixedBlock{121.980}{688.802}{400.020}{\rmfamily\raggedright}{9.96}{12.00}{%
 the update region set used for sending the interaction,%
 }
