 \HLAServiceHeadingAt{279.383}{%
 \textbf{9.13 }\textbf{\emph{Request Attribute Value Update With Regions}}\textbf{ service}%
 }
 \HLAFixedBlock{90.000}{304.806}{432.000}{\rmfamily\raggedright}{9.96}{12.00}{%
 The \emph{Request Attribute Value Update With Regions} service shall be used to stimulate the update of values of%
 }
 \HLAFixedBlock{90.000}{316.805}{432.000}{\rmfamily\raggedright}{9.96}{12.00}{%
 specified attributes. The RTI shall solicit the values of the specified instance attributes, for all object%
 }
 \HLAFixedBlock{90.000}{328.805}{432.000}{\rmfamily\raggedright}{9.96}{12.00}{%
 instances registered at that class and all subclasses of that class, from their owners using the \emph{Provide}%
 }
 \HLAFixedBlock{90.000}{340.805}{432.000}{\rmfamily\raggedright}{9.96}{12.00}{%
 \emph{Attribute Value Update \textdagger{} }service. The resulting \emph{Provide Attribute Value Update \textdagger{} }service invocations issued%
 }
 \HLAFixedBlock{90.000}{352.805}{432.000}{\rmfamily\raggedright}{9.96}{12.00}{%
 by the RTI shall be consistent with the region sets provided to this service. An invocation shall be consistent%
 }
 \HLAFixedBlock{90.000}{364.805}{432.000}{\rmfamily\raggedright}{9.96}{12.00}{%
 with the provided region sets if the instance attributes in an updating joined federate are associated with an%
 }
 \HLAFixedBlock{90.000}{376.805}{432.000}{\rmfamily\raggedright}{9.96}{12.00}{%
 update region set that overlaps with the corresponding region set.%
 }
 \HLAFixedBlock{90.000}{400.804}{432.000}{\rmfamily\raggedright}{9.96}{12.00}{%
 The timestamp of any resulting \emph{Reflect Attribute Values \textdagger{}} service invocations shall be determined by the%
 }
 \HLAFixedBlock{90.000}{412.804}{432.000}{\rmfamily\raggedright}{9.96}{12.00}{%
 updating joined federate.%
 }
 \HLAFixedBlock{90.000}{436.804}{432.000}{\rmfamily\raggedright}{9.96}{12.00}{%
 If the federate invoking this service also owns some of the instance attributes whose values are being%
 }
 \HLAFixedBlock{90.000}{448.803}{432.000}{\rmfamily\raggedright}{9.96}{12.00}{%
 requested, it shall not have the \emph{Provide Attribute Value Update\textdagger{}} service invoked on it by the RTI. The%
 }
 \HLAFixedBlock{90.000}{460.803}{432.000}{\rmfamily\raggedright}{9.96}{12.00}{%
 request is taken as an implicit invocation of the provide service at the requesting federate for all qualified%
 }
 \HLAFixedBlock{90.000}{472.803}{432.000}{\rmfamily\raggedright}{9.96}{12.00}{%
 instance attributes that it owns.%
 }
 \HLAFixedBlock{90.000}{496.803}{432.000}{\rmfamily\raggedright}{9.96}{12.00}{%
 This service does not allow the use of object instances. If a federate wants to request the update of%
 }
 \HLAFixedBlock{90.000}{508.802}{432.000}{\rmfamily\raggedright}{9.96}{12.00}{%
 instance attributes of a single object instance, use of the \emph{Request Attribute Value Update} service is sufficient,%
 }
 \HLAFixedBlock{90.001}{520.802}{431.999}{\rmfamily\raggedright}{9.96}{12.00}{%
 and the use of DDM provides no additional benefit.%
 }
 \HLAFixedBlock{90.001}{544.802}{431.999}{\rmfamily\raggedright}{9.96}{12.00}{%
 If the region set paired with a class attribute is empty, no request for update shall be issued for the class%
 }
 \HLAFixedBlock{90.001}{556.802}{431.999}{\rmfamily\raggedright}{9.96}{12.00}{%
 attribute, not even with the default region. Use of an empty set is not equivalent to invocation of the \emph{Request}%
 }
 \HLAFixedBlock{90.001}{568.801}{431.999}{\rmfamily\raggedright}{9.96}{12.00}{%
 \emph{Attribute Value Update} service.%
 }
 \HLAFixedBlock{90.001}{592.801}{431.999}{\rmfamily\raggedright}{9.96}{12.00}{%
 The user-supplied tag argument shall be provided with all corresponding \emph{Provide Attribute Value Update \textdagger{}}%
 }
 \HLAFixedBlock{90.001}{604.801}{431.999}{\rmfamily\raggedright}{9.96}{12.00}{%
 service invocations.%
 }
