 HLAmanager.HLAfederation.HLAadjust). The RTI shall subscribe at the MOM leaf-class level%
 }
 \HLAFixedBlock{121.979}{132.785}{482.021}{\rmfamily\raggedright}{9.96}{11.16}{%
 (e.g., HLAmanager.HLAfederate.HLAadjust.HLAsetTiming). It shall receive these interactions and%
