 \HLAFixedBlock{121.980}{93.785}{482.020}{\rmfamily\raggedright}{9.96}{11.16}{%
 each such interaction shall contain only the HLAfederate and HLAserviceGroup dimensions as%
 }
 \HLAFixedBlock{121.980}{105.785}{482.020}{\rmfamily\raggedright}{9.96}{11.16}{%
 specified dimensions. The range used for the HLAfederate dimension shall be a point range around%
 }
 \HLAFixedBlock{121.980}{117.785}{482.020}{\rmfamily\raggedright}{9.96}{11.16}{%
 the normalized value (using the %
