 j)%
 }
 \HLAFixedBlock{121.945}{165.784}{482.055}{\rmfamily\raggedright}{9.96}{11.16}{%
 The RTI shall send all other interactions that are of subclasses of HLAmanager.HLA-%
 }
 \HLAFixedBlock{121.980}{177.784}{482.020}{\rmfamily\raggedright}{9.96}{11.16}{%
 federate.HLAreport in Table 7 using an update region set that contains a single region. The region%
 }
 \HLAFixedBlock{121.980}{189.784}{482.020}{\rmfamily\raggedright}{9.96}{11.16}{%
 used with each such interaction shall contain only the HLAfederate dimension as a specified%
 }
 \HLAFixedBlock{121.980}{201.784}{482.020}{\rmfamily\raggedright}{9.96}{11.16}{%
 dimension. The range for that dimension shall be a point range around the normalized value (using%
 }
 \HLAFixedBlock{121.980}{213.783}{482.020}{\rmfamily\raggedright}{9.96}{11.16}{%
 the %
 }
 \HLAFixedBlock{136.680}{213.783}{467.320}{\rmfamily\raggedright}{9.96}{11.16}{%
 \emph{Normalize Federate Handle }%
 }
 \HLAFixedBlock{251.339}{213.783}{352.661}{\rmfamily\raggedright}{9.96}{11.16}{%
 service) of the HLAfederate parameter of that interaction.%
