 \HLAFixedBlock{100.019}{225.783}{503.981}{\rmfamily\raggedright}{9.96}{11.16}{%
 k)%
 }
 \HLAFixedBlock{121.979}{225.783}{482.021}{\rmfamily\raggedright}{9.96}{11.16}{%
 Other than registering and deleting object instances, updating instance attributes, and sending and%
 }
 \HLAFixedBlock{121.979}{237.783}{482.021}{\rmfamily\raggedright}{9.96}{11.16}{%
 receiving interactions, the RTI shall not engage in any other activity with regard to MOM. In other%
 }
 \HLAFixedBlock{121.979}{249.783}{482.021}{\rmfamily\raggedright}{9.96}{11.16}{%
 words, among other things, an RTI shall never%
 }
 \HLAFixedBlock{121.979}{264.783}{482.021}{\rmfamily\raggedright}{9.96}{11.16}{%
 1)%
 }
 \HLAFixedBlock{142.024}{264.783}{461.976}{\rmfamily\raggedright}{9.96}{11.16}{%
 Engage in ownership transfer of MOM instance attributes.%
 }
 \HLAFixedBlock{121.979}{279.782}{482.021}{\rmfamily\raggedright}{9.96}{11.16}{%
 2)%
 }
 \HLAFixedBlock{142.026}{279.782}{461.974}{\rmfamily\raggedright}{9.96}{11.16}{%
 Modify the transportation or order type of a MOM instance attribute or interaction class.%
 }
 \HLAFixedBlock{121.979}{294.782}{482.021}{\rmfamily\raggedright}{9.96}{11.16}{%
 3)%
 }
 \HLAFixedBlock{142.023}{294.782}{461.977}{\rmfamily\raggedright}{9.96}{11.16}{%
 Use DDM services with MOM instance attributes or interaction classes, except as noted above.%
 }
 \HLAFixedBlock{100.018}{309.782}{503.982}{\rmfamily\raggedright}{9.96}{11.16}{%
 l)%
 }
 \HLAFixedBlock{121.950}{309.782}{482.050}{\rmfamily\raggedright}{9.96}{11.16}{%
 Unless specifically noted otherwise in Table 20, when a federate sends an interaction, it shall always%
 }
 \HLAFixedBlock{121.978}{321.782}{482.022}{\rmfamily\raggedright}{9.96}{11.16}{%
 supply all pre-defined parameters that are available at that interaction class and no more, with the%
 }
 \HLAFixedBlock{121.978}{333.782}{482.022}{\rmfamily\raggedright}{9.96}{11.16}{%
 following exceptions:%
 }
 \HLAFixedBlock{121.978}{348.781}{482.022}{\rmfamily\raggedright}{9.96}{11.16}{%
 1)%
 }
 \HLAFixedBlock{142.023}{348.781}{461.977}{\rmfamily\raggedright}{9.96}{11.16}{%
 A federate shall not be required to supply parameters of any HLAmanager.HLA-%
 }
 \HLAFixedBlock{142.018}{360.781}{461.982}{\rmfamily\raggedright}{9.96}{11.16}{%
 federate.HLAservice interaction that correspond to optional arguments of the HLA service that%
