 the HLAmanager.HLAfederate.HLAservice interaction is intended to cause to be invoked on%
 }
 \HLAFixedBlock{142.018}{384.781}{461.982}{\rmfamily\raggedright}{9.96}{11.16}{%
 behalf of another federate. (For example, HLAattributeList is not a required parameter of%
 }
 \HLAFixedBlock{142.018}{396.781}{461.982}{\rmfamily\raggedright}{9.96}{11.16}{%
 the HLAmanager.HLAfederate.HLAservice.HLAunpublishObjectClassAttributes interaction%
 }
 \HLAFixedBlock{142.018}{408.780}{461.982}{\rmfamily\raggedright}{9.96}{11.16}{%
 because the set of attribute designators argument of the %
