 \HLAFixedBlock{89.999}{556.661}{514.001}{\rmfamily\raggedright}{9.96}{11.16}{%
 \textbf{11.5.2 Logging service reports}%
 }
 \HLAFixedBlock{89.999}{580.800}{514.001}{\rmfamily\raggedright}{9.96}{11.16}{%
 When the Send Service Reports to File Switch is enabled, generated service report interactions shall be%
 }
 \HLAFixedBlock{89.999}{592.800}{514.001}{\rmfamily\raggedright}{9.96}{11.16}{%
 recorded in a text log file instead of sent to subscribed federates. Each interaction will create a separate%
 }
 \HLAFixedBlock{89.999}{604.800}{514.001}{\rmfamily\raggedright}{9.96}{11.16}{%
 service report record in the log file encoded using the same JSON-like format used for encoding arguments.%
 }
 \HLAFixedBlock{89.999}{616.800}{514.001}{\rmfamily\raggedright}{9.96}{11.16}{%
 Each joined federate whose Send Service Reports to File Switch is enabled shall write its service reports%
 }
 \HLAFixedBlock{89.999}{628.800}{514.001}{\rmfamily\raggedright}{9.96}{11.16}{%
 records to a unique service report file. The name and location of the file is implementation dependent;%
 }
 \HLAFixedBlock{89.999}{640.799}{514.001}{\rmfamily\raggedright}{9.96}{11.16}{%
 however, this information shall be provided in the HLAreportServiceFile attribute of the%
 }
 \HLAFixedBlock{89.999}{652.799}{514.001}{\rmfamily\raggedright}{9.96}{11.16}{%
 HLA.manager.HLAfederate object. The service report file shall begin with initial records that contain the%
 }
 \HLAFixedBlock{89.999}{664.799}{514.001}{\rmfamily\raggedright}{9.96}{11.16}{%
 information provided during the federate's connect service call and about the joined federation and joined%
 }
 \HLAFixedBlock{89.999}{676.799}{514.001}{\rmfamily\raggedright}{9.96}{11.16}{%
 federate. These records shall be included in the file even if the Send Service Reports to File Switch was%
 }
 \HLAFixedBlock{89.999}{688.799}{514.001}{\rmfamily\raggedright}{9.96}{11.16}{%
 disabled when these events took place. Following the initial records, the file shall contain a record for any%
 }
 \HLAFixedBlock{89.999}{700.798}{514.001}{\rmfamily\raggedright}{9.96}{11.16}{%
 service report interaction that was generated while the Service Reporting and Send Service Reports to File%
 }
