 \HLAFixedBlock{90.000}{69.786}{514.000}{\rmfamily\raggedright}{9.96}{11.16}{%
 The encoded data generated by handle encoding helpers shall use the corresponding HLA<type>Handle data%
 }
 \HLAFixedBlock{90.000}{81.785}{514.000}{\rmfamily\raggedright}{9.96}{11.16}{%
 type as defined in HLAstandardMIM. Handle decoders shall not attempt to check the (semantic) validity of%
 }
 \HLAFixedBlock{90.000}{93.785}{514.000}{\rmfamily\raggedright}{9.96}{11.16}{%
 the decoded handle. Table 24 lists all handle encoding helpers available in Java.%
 }
 \HLAFixedBlock{90.000}{382.666}{514.000}{\rmfamily\raggedright}{9.96}{11.16}{%
 \textbf{12.11.5 Services}%
 }
 \HLAFixedBlock{90.000}{406.805}{514.000}{\rmfamily\raggedright}{9.96}{11.16}{%
 In general, each service in Clause 4 through Clause 10 corresponds to one method in each API. In some%
 }
 \HLAFixedBlock{90.000}{418.805}{514.000}{\rmfamily\raggedright}{9.96}{11.16}{%
 cases, because of optional arguments to a service or programming language constraints, a single service may%
 }
 \HLAFixedBlock{90.000}{430.805}{514.000}{\rmfamily\raggedright}{9.96}{11.16}{%
 be mapped to multiple methods in an API.%
 }
 \HLAFixedBlock{90.000}{454.804}{514.000}{\rmfamily\raggedright}{9.96}{11.16}{%
 For the Java API, the federate-initiated services invoked on the RTI are methods of the %
 }
 \HLAFixedBlock{444.060}{455.392}{159.940}{\rmfamily\raggedright}{9.96}{11.16}{%
 \textbf{RTIambassador}%
 }
 \HLAFixedBlock{90.000}{466.804}{514.000}{\rmfamily\raggedright}{9.96}{11.16}{%
 interface, and RTI-initiated service callbacks on the federate are methods of the %
 }
 \HLAFixedBlock{414.060}{467.392}{189.940}{\rmfamily\raggedright}{9.96}{11.16}{%
 \textbf{FederateAmbassador}%
 }
 \HLAFixedBlock{90.000}{478.804}{514.000}{\rmfamily\raggedright}{9.96}{11.16}{%
 interface. The RTI and federate ambassador services in the Java API that do not follow a one-to-one%
 }
 \HLAFixedBlock{90.000}{490.804}{514.000}{\rmfamily\raggedright}{9.96}{11.16}{%
 mapping with the services in Clause 4 through Clause 10 of the specification are described in 12.11.5.1%
 }
 \HLAFixedBlock{90.000}{502.804}{514.000}{\rmfamily\raggedright}{9.96}{11.16}{%
 through 12.11.5.36.%
 }
 \HLAFixedBlock{90.000}{526.664}{514.000}{\rmfamily\raggedright}{9.96}{11.16}{%
 \textbf{12.11.5.1 }%
 }
 \HLAFixedBlock{133.920}{526.664}{470.080}{\rmfamily\raggedright}{9.96}{11.16}{%
 \textbf{\emph{Create Federation Execution}}%
 }
 \HLAFixedBlock{269.400}{526.664}{334.600}{\rmfamily\raggedright}{9.96}{11.16}{%
 \textbf{ service}%
 }
 \HLAFixedBlock{90.000}{550.803}{514.000}{\rmfamily\raggedright}{9.96}{11.16}{%
 The set of FOM module designators argument is implemented as an array of strings where each item in the%
 }
 \HLAFixedBlock{90.000}{562.803}{514.000}{\rmfamily\raggedright}{9.96}{11.16}{%
 array is either a file path or a URI for a file containing one FOM module.%
 }
 \HLAFixedBlock{90.000}{586.802}{514.000}{\rmfamily\raggedright}{9.96}{11.16}{%
 In addition to the supplied arguments listed with the description of this service, the Java API requires the%
 }
 \HLAFixedBlock{90.000}{598.802}{514.000}{\rmfamily\raggedright}{9.96}{11.16}{%
 federate to supply a %
 }
 \HLAFixedBlock{176.640}{599.390}{427.360}{\rmfamily\raggedright}{9.96}{11.16}{%
 \textbf{String logicalTimeImplementationName}%
 }
 \HLAFixedBlock{395.881}{598.802}{208.119}{\rmfamily\raggedright}{9.96}{11.16}{%
 that contains the name of the%
 }
 \HLAFixedBlock{90.001}{610.802}{513.999}{\rmfamily\raggedright}{9.96}{11.16}{%
 logical time implementation. In addition to the specified exceptions listed with the description of this%
 }
 \HLAFixedBlock{90.001}{622.802}{513.999}{\rmfamily\raggedright}{9.96}{11.16}{%
 service, the Java API may also throw a %
 }
 \HLAFixedBlock{262.441}{623.389}{341.559}{\rmfamily\raggedright}{9.96}{11.16}{%
 \textbf{CouldNotCreateLogicalTimeFactory}%
 }
 \HLAFixedBlock{454.322}{622.802}{149.678}{\rmfamily\raggedright}{9.96}{11.16}{%
 . This exception%
 }
 \HLAFixedBlock{90.002}{634.801}{513.998}{\rmfamily\raggedright}{9.96}{11.16}{%
 indicates that the RTI was not able to create an instance of the logical time factory class that was named in%
 }
 \HLAFixedBlock{90.002}{646.801}{513.998}{\rmfamily\raggedright}{9.96}{11.16}{%
 the %
 }
 \HLAFixedBlock{104.702}{647.389}{499.298}{\rmfamily\raggedright}{9.96}{11.16}{%
 \textbf{String logicalTimeImplementationName}%
 }
 \HLAFixedBlock{320.582}{646.801}{283.418}{\rmfamily\raggedright}{9.96}{11.16}{%
