 message. This message is sent from the RTI to the federate.%
 }
 \HLAFixedBlock{90.000}{117.785}{514.000}{\rmfamily\raggedright}{9.96}{11.16}{%
 For a given HLA Service callback, two messages are used:%
 }
 \HLAFixedBlock{100.020}{141.785}{503.980}{\rmfamily\raggedright}{9.96}{11.16}{%
 ---%
 }
 \HLAFixedBlock{121.981}{141.785}{482.019}{\rmfamily\raggedright}{9.96}{11.16}{%
 A CallbackRequest message representing the callback and its arguments, for example the%
 }
 \HLAFixedBlock{121.981}{153.784}{482.019}{\rmfamily\raggedright}{9.96}{11.16}{%
 DiscoverObjectInstance message. This message is sent from the RTI to the federate.%
