 }
 \HLAFixedBlock{90.000}{93.785}{514.000}{\rmfamily\raggedright}{9.96}{11.16}{%
 The following state diagrams give a more exact specification for the federate and RTI behaviors including%
 }
 \HLAFixedBlock{90.000}{105.785}{514.000}{\rmfamily\raggedright}{9.96}{11.16}{%
 error handling. The following terminology is used in the diagrams:%
 }
 \HLAFixedBlock{90.000}{129.785}{514.000}{\rmfamily\raggedright}{9.96}{11.16}{%
 Connection broken%
 }
 \HLAFixedBlock{100.020}{153.786}{503.980}{\rmfamily\raggedright}{9.96}{11.16}{%
 ---%
 }
 \HLAFixedBlock{121.980}{153.786}{482.020}{\rmfamily\raggedright}{9.96}{11.16}{%
 The application cannot read or write from/to the socket.%
 }
 \HLAFixedBlock{100.020}{165.785}{503.980}{\rmfamily\raggedright}{9.96}{11.16}{%
 ---%
 }
 \HLAFixedBlock{121.980}{165.785}{482.020}{\rmfamily\raggedright}{9.96}{11.16}{%
 The socket has been closed, for example by the operating system.%
 }
 \HLAFixedBlock{90.000}{189.785}{514.000}{\rmfamily\raggedright}{9.96}{11.16}{%
 Bad message received%
 }
 \HLAFixedBlock{100.020}{213.786}{503.980}{\rmfamily\raggedright}{9.96}{11.16}{%
 ---%
 }
 \HLAFixedBlock{121.980}{213.786}{482.020}{\rmfamily\raggedright}{9.96}{11.16}{%
 The message has an incorrect format.%
 }
 \HLAFixedBlock{100.020}{225.785}{503.980}{\rmfamily\raggedright}{9.96}{11.16}{%
 ---%
 }
 \HLAFixedBlock{121.980}{225.785}{482.020}{\rmfamily\raggedright}{9.96}{11.16}{%
 The message has an incorrect sequence number in the header.%
 }
 \HLAFixedBlock{100.020}{237.785}{503.980}{\rmfamily\raggedright}{9.96}{11.16}{%
 ---%
 }
 \HLAFixedBlock{121.980}{237.785}{482.020}{\rmfamily\raggedright}{9.96}{11.16}{%
 The message has an incorrect session ID in the header.%
 }
 \HLAFixedBlock{100.020}{249.785}{503.980}{\rmfamily\raggedright}{9.96}{11.16}{%
 ---%
 }
 \HLAFixedBlock{121.980}{249.785}{482.020}{\rmfamily\raggedright}{9.96}{11.16}{%
 A message of the wrong type has been received, given the current state.%
 }
 \HLAFixedBlock{90.000}{273.645}{514.000}{\rmfamily\raggedright}{9.96}{11.16}{%
 \textbf{12.13.4.7.1 Detailed Federate State Diagrams}%
 }
 \HLAFixedBlock{90.000}{297.784}{514.000}{\rmfamily\raggedright}{9.96}{11.16}{%
 The following diagrams specify the states of the federate and the RTI including all exception handling.%
 }
