 successful invocation of the \emph{Join Federation Execution} service, a federate will be in the Joined Federate\linebreak%
 }
 \HLAFixedBlock{90.001}{432.785}{431.999}{\rmfamily}{9.96}{12.00}{%
 state, where distributed simulation activities take place. If an infrastructure problem is detected during these\linebreak%
 }
 \HLAFixedBlock{90.001}{444.784}{431.999}{\rmfamily}{9.96}{12.00}{%
 activities, the \emph{Connection Lost \textdagger{}}\HLASupMark{15} service notifies the federate that a fault has been detected and that it has\linebreak%
 }
 \HLAFixedBlock{90.000}{456.785}{432.000}{\rmfamily}{9.96}{12.00}{%
 been forced to the Not Connected state. If previously joined, it shall be now no longer joined to the\linebreak%
 }
 \HLAFixedBlock{90.000}{468.785}{432.000}{\rmfamily}{9.96}{12.00}{%
 federation execution. As described in 4.1.5, the effect will be as if the federate had resigned with a resign\linebreak%
 }
 \HLAFixedBlock{90.000}{480.785}{432.000}{\rmfamily}{9.96}{12.00}{%
 action specified by the Automatic Resign Directive. Following successful simulation activities, the federate\linebreak%
 }
 \HLAFixedBlock{90.000}{492.785}{432.000}{\rmfamily}{9.96}{12.00}{%
 invokes the \emph{Resign Federation Execution} service to leave the Joined Federate state. If a federate is forced to\linebreak%
 }
 \HLAFixedBlock{90.000}{504.785}{432.000}{\rmfamily}{9.96}{12.00}{%
 leave the joined state for any reason other than calling the \emph{Resign Federation Execution} service, the\linebreak%
 }
 \HLAFixedBlock{89.999}{516.785}{432.001}{\rmfamily}{9.96}{12.00}{%
 \emph{Federate Resigned \textdagger{}} service notifies the federate that a fault has been detected and that it has been forced\linebreak%
 }
 \HLAFixedBlock{89.999}{528.784}{432.001}{\rmfamily}{9.96}{12.00}{%
 into the Not Joined state. When a federate has resigned and has no further intent to join or create federation\linebreak%
 }
 \HLAFixedBlock{89.999}{540.784}{432.001}{\rmfamily}{9.96}{12.00}{%
 executions, it shall perform a \emph{Disconnect}. The \emph{Disconnect} service allows the RTI to break down and clean\linebreak%
 }
 \HLAFixedBlock{89.999}{552.784}{418.971}{\rmfamily\raggedright}{9.96}{12.00}{%
 up its communication infrastructure. Figure 4 shows the federate’s lifetime in the Joined Federate state.%
 }
